"git.[at].john-livingston.fr helbidera idatziz, edo ikusi nire [Liberapay "
"profila](https://liberapay.com/JohnLivingston/)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/codeofconduct/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contributor Covenant Code of Conduct"
msgstr "Contributor Covenant jokabide-kodea"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/codeofconduct/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Code of Conduct"
msgstr "Jokabide-kodea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/codeofconduct/_index.md
msgid "This Code of Conduct is adapted from the [Contributor Covenant](https://www.contributor-covenant.org), version 2.1, available at [https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct.html](https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct.html).  Translations are available at [https://www.contributor-covenant.org/translations](https://www.contributor-covenant.org/translations).  Instances of abusive, harassing, or otherwise unacceptable behavior may be reported to the community leaders responsible for enforcement by mail at git.[at].john-livingston.fr."
msgstr ""
"Jokabide-kode hau [Contributor Covenant](https://www.contributor-"
"covenant.org) kodearen 2.1 bertsiotik egokitua da, helbide honetan "
"eskuragarri: [https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/"
"code_of_conduct.html](https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/"
"code_of_conduct.html).  Itzulpenak helbide honetan daude: [https://"
"www.contributor-covenant.org/translations](https://www.contributor-"
"covenant.org/translations).  Portaera iraingarri, jazarle edo bestela "
"onartezinen berri eman dakieke aplikatzeaz arduratzen diren komunitateko "
"arduradunei, git.[at].john-livingston.fr helbidera idatziz."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Develop"
msgstr "Garatu"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Always talk about features you want to develop by creating/finding and commenting the issue tackling your problem before you start working on it, and inform the community that you begin coding by claiming the issue."
msgstr ""
"Garatu nahi dituzun eginbideei buruz hitz egin beti, zure arazoa jorratzen "
"duen arazo-txostena sortuz edo bilatuz eta iruzkinduz, lanean hasi aurretik; "
"eta jakinarazi komunitateari kodetzen hasten zarela, arazo-txostena zuretzat "
"hartuz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Pull Request must be done on the `main` branch."
msgstr "Pull Requestak `main` adarrean egin behar dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Until march 2023, contribution were made on the `develop` branch. This procedure is now deprecated."
msgstr ""
"2023ko martxora arte, ekarpenak `develop` adarrean egiten ziren. Prozedura "
"hori zaharkituta dago orain."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisite for building this plugin"
msgstr "Osagarri hau eraikitzeko aurrebaldintzak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "It is highly recommended to be familiar with following concepts:"
msgstr "Oso gomendagarria da kontzeptu hauek ezagutzea:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Git"
msgstr "Git"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "NodeJS"
msgstr "NodeJS"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "NPM"
msgstr "NPM"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Typescript"
msgstr "Typescript"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "To build the plugin, you must have following packages:"
msgstr "Osagarria eraikitzeko, pakete hauek izan behar dituzu:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "`git`"
msgstr "`git`"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "`npm` (>=8.x)"
msgstr "`npm` (>=8.x)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "`nodejs` (>=14.x)"
msgstr "`nodejs` (>=14.x)"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "`build-essential`"
msgstr "`build-essential`"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "`coreutils`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "`wget`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "`reuse`"
msgstr "`reuse`"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Please note that this plugin needs an AppImage for the Prosody XMPP server.  This AppImage is provided by the [Prosody AppImage](https://github.com/JohnXLivingston/prosody-appimage) sideproject.  The `build-prosody.sh` script download binaries attached to this remote repository, and checks that their sha256 hashsum are correct."
msgstr ""
"Kontuan hartu osagarri honek AppImage bat behar duela Prosody XMPP "
"zerbitzarirako.  AppImage hori [Prosody AppImage](https://github.com/"
"JohnXLivingston/prosody-appimage) albo-proiektuak eskaintzen du.  `build-"
"prosody.sh` scriptak urruneko biltegi horri erantsitako bitarrak "
"deskargatzen ditu, eta haien sha256 hash-batura zuzena dela egiaztatzen du."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Clone the repository, buid the plugin, and create your feature branch:"
msgstr "Klonatu biltegia, eraiki osagarria eta sortu zure eginbide-adarra:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Clone the repository. Dont forget the --recursive to clone submodules.\n"
"git clone https://github.com/JohnXLivingston/peertube-plugin-livechat.git --recursive\n"
"\n"
"cd peertube-plugin-livechat\n"
"\n"
"# Install NPM dependencies and build the module for the first time:\n"
"npm install\n"
"\n"
"# Build the plugin after a modification:\n"
"npm run build\n"
"\n"
"# If you have a fork from the repository, add it as remote (example):\n"
"git remote add me git@github.com:MY_GITHUB_ACCOUNT/peertube-plugin-livechat.git\n"
"\n"
"# Create a local branch for you developments, and checkout it (example):\n"
"git checkout my_development # Note: if an issue is associated, use fix_1234 as your branch name (where 1234 is the issue's number)\n"
"# To propose your modifications, push your branch to your repository (example):\n"
"git push --set-upstream me my_development\n"
"# Then go to your github repository with your web browser to propose the Pull Request (see additional instructions below)\n"
msgstr ""
"# Klonatu biltegia. Ez ahaztu --recursive azpimoduluak klonatzeko.\n"
"git clone https://github.com/JohnXLivingston/peertube-plugin-livechat.git --"
"recursive\n"
"\n"
"cd peertube-plugin-livechat\n"
"\n"
"# Instalatu NPM mendekotasunak eta eraiki modulua lehen aldiz:\n"
"npm install\n"
"\n"
"# Eraiki osagarria aldaketa baten ondoren:\n"
"npm run build\n"
"\n"
"# Biltegiaren fork bat baduzu, gehitu urruneko gisa (adibidea):\n"
"git remote add me git@github.com:MY_GITHUB_ACCOUNT/peertube-plugin-"
"livechat.git\n"
"\n"
"# Sortu adar lokal bat zure garapenetarako, eta aldatu hartara (adibidea):\n"
"git checkout my_development # Oharra: arazo-txosten bat lotuta badago, "
"erabili fix_1234 adarraren izen gisa (1234 arazo-txostenaren zenbakia izanik)"
"\n"
"# Zure aldaketak proposatzeko, bidali zure adarra zure biltegira (adibidea)"
":\n"
"git push --set-upstream me my_development\n"
"# Ondoren, joan zure GitHub biltegira web-nabigatzailearekin Pull Requesta "
"proposatzeko (ikusi argibide gehigarriak behean)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Once you are ready to show your code to ask for feedback, submit a *draft* Pull Request.  Once you are ready for a code review before merge, submit a Pull Request.  In any case, please link your PR to the issues it solves by using the GitHub syntax: \"fixes #issue_number\"."
msgstr ""
"Zure kodea erakusteko eta iritziak eskatzeko prest zaudenean, bidali "
"*zirriborro* gisako Pull Request bat.  Batu aurretik kode-berrikuspen "
"baterako prest zaudenean, bidali Pull Request bat.  Edonola ere, lotu zure "
"PRa konpontzen dituen arazo-txostenekin GitHuben sintaxia erabiliz: \"fixes "
"#arazo_zenbakia\"."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "The front-end code is in the `client` folder, the back-end code in `server`. There are some shared code in `shared` folder."
msgstr ""
"Front-end kodea `client` karpetan dago, eta back-end kodea `server` "
"karpetan. Partekatutako kode batzuk `shared` karpetan daude."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "For general instructions (developping plugins, building, installation, ...), please refer to the [Peertube documentation](https://docs.joinpeertube.org/contribute-plugins?id=write-a-plugintheme)."
msgstr ""
"Argibide orokorretarako (osagarriak garatzea, eraikitzea, instalatzea, ...), "
"ikusi [PeerTuberen dokumentazioa](https://docs.joinpeertube.org/contribute-"
"plugins?id=write-a-plugintheme)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "You can build the plugin with extra debug features simply by using:"
msgstr ""
"Osagarria arazketa-eginbide gehigarriekin eraiki dezakezu, hau erabiliz "
"besterik gabe:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "NODE_ENV=dev npm run build\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "This plugin is [REUSE](https://reuse.software/) compliant: it uses SPDX headers to identify licensing information of its source code.  More information on the [REUSE](https://reuse.software/) website.  You can use the [reuse](https://reuse.readthedocs.io/en/stable/readme.html#) command line tool to help you update headers.  The `npm run lint` command will use the `reuse` command to check compliance.  Don't forget to add your copyright information in SPDX headers when you modify some code."
msgstr ""
"Osagarri hau [REUSE](https://reuse.software/) arauekin bat dator: SPDX "
"goiburuak erabiltzen ditu iturburu-kodearen lizentzia-informazioa "
"identifikatzeko.  Informazio gehiago [REUSE](https://reuse.software/) "
"webgunean.  [reuse](https://reuse.readthedocs.io/en/stable/readme.html#) "
"komando-lerroko tresna erabil dezakezu goiburuak eguneratzen laguntzeko.  "
"`npm run lint` komandoak `reuse` komandoa erabiliko du betetzen dela "
"egiaztatzeko.  Ez ahaztu zure copyright informazioa SPDX goiburuetan "
"gehitzea kodea aldatzen duzunean."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ESBuild vs Typescript"
msgstr "ESBuild vs Typescript"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "This plugin uses ESBuild for frontend code generation, as the official `peertube-plugin-quickstart` plugin.  ESBuild can handle Typescript, but does not check types (see [ESBuild documentation](https://esbuild.github.io/content-types/#typescript)).  That's why we first compile Typescript with the `-noEmit` option, just to check types (`check:client:ts` in package.json file).  Then, if everything is okay, we run ESBuild to generate the compiled javascript."
msgstr ""
"Osagarri honek ESBuild erabiltzen du frontend kodea sortzeko, `peertube-"
"plugin-quickstart` osagarri ofizialak bezala.  ESBuildek Typescript kudea "
"dezake, baina ez ditu motak egiaztatzen (ikusi [ESBuilden dokumentazioa]"
"(https://esbuild.github.io/content-types/#typescript)).  Horregatik, lehenik "
"Typescript konpilatzen dugu `-noEmit` aukerarekin, motak egiaztatzeko soilik "
"(`check:client:ts` package.json fitxategian).  Ondoren, dena ondo badago, "
"ESBuild exekutatzen dugu javascript konpilatua sortzeko."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debug Mode"
msgstr "Arazketa modua"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "There is a debug mode for this plugin, that shorten some delay.  For example, some log files will rotate every two minutes, instead of once per day.  This permit to test more easily certain actions, for which it could normally take hours or days to wait."
msgstr ""
"Osagarri honek arazketa modu bat du, atzerapen batzuk laburtzen dituena.  "
"Adibidez, erregistro-fitxategi batzuk bi minuturo txandakatuko dira, egunean "
"behin ordez.  Horri esker, errazago probatu daitezke normalean orduak edo "
"egunak itxaron beharko liratekeen ekintza batzuk."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "To enable this mode, you juste have to create the `/var/www/peertube/storage/plugins/data/peertube-plugin-livechat/debug_mode` file (replacing `/var/www/peertube/storage/` by the correct path on your installation)."
msgstr ""
"Modu hau gaitzeko, `/var/www/peertube/storage/plugins/data/peertube-plugin-"
"livechat/debug_mode` fitxategia sortu besterik ez duzu egin behar (`/var/www/"
"peertube/storage/` zure instalazioko bide zuzenarekin ordeztuz)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "The simple existence of this file is sufficient to trigger the debug mode.  To make sure it's taken into account, you can restart your Peertube instance."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi hori egote hutsa nahikoa da arazketa modua abiarazteko.  Kontuan "
"hartzen dela ziurtatzeko, zure PeerTube instantzia berrabiarazi dezakezu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "This file can contain some JSON to enable more advanced options.  To have a list of existing parameters, check `server/lib/debug.ts`.  Restart Peertube after each content modification."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi honek JSON eduki bat izan dezake aukera aurreratuagoak gaitzeko.  "
"Dauden parametroen zerrenda ikusteko, begiratu `server/lib/debug.ts`.  "
"Berrabiarazi PeerTube edukia aldatzen duzun bakoitzean."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Don't enable this mode on a production server, neither on a public server.  This could cause security issues."
msgstr ""
"Ez gaitu modu hau ekoizpen-zerbitzari batean, ezta zerbitzari publiko batean "
"ere.  Segurtasun-arazoak sor ditzake."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restart Prosody"
msgstr "Berrabiarazi Prosody"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "When debug mode is enabled, you can restart Prosody using this API call: `http://your_instance.tld/plugins/livechat/router/api/restart_prosody`.  This call don't need any authentificaiton.  It can be done from a command line, for example using `curl http://your_instance.tld/plugins/livechat/router/api/restart_prosody`."
msgstr ""
"Arazketa modua gaituta dagoenean, Prosody berrabiarazi dezakezu API dei hau "
"erabiliz: `http://your_instance.tld/plugins/livechat/router/api/"
"restart_prosody`.  Dei honek ez du autentifikaziorik behar.  Komando-"
"lerrotik egin daiteke, adibidez `curl http://your_instance.tld/plugins/"
"livechat/router/api/restart_prosody` erabiliz."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prosody debugger"
msgstr "Prosody araztailea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "It is possible to connect the Prosody AppImage to a remote debugger using [MobDebug](https://luarocks.org/modules/paulclinger/mobdebug)."
msgstr ""
"Prosody AppImagea urruneko araztaile batera konekta daiteke [MobDebug]"
"(https://luarocks.org/modules/paulclinger/mobdebug) erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "To do so, you have to setup MobDebug in a folder that can be accessed by the `peertube` user.  Then, add this in the `debub_mode` file:"
msgstr ""
"Horretarako, MobDebug konfiguratu behar duzu `peertube` erabiltzaileak atzi "
"dezakeen karpeta batean.  Ondoren, gehitu hau `debub_mode` fitxategian:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"debug_prosody\": {\n"
"    \"debugger_path\": \"/the_path_to_mobdebug/src\",\n"
"    \"host\": \"localhost\",\n"
"    \"port\": \"8172\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"debug_prosody\": {\n"
"    \"debugger_path\": \"/the_path_to_mobdebug/src\",\n"
"    \"host\": \"localhost\",\n"
"    \"port\": \"8172\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "`host` and `port` are optional. `debugger_path` must point to the folder where the `MobDebug` `.lua` file is."
msgstr ""
"`host` eta `port` aukerakoak dira. `debugger_path` aukerak `MobDebug` `.lua` "
"fitxategia dagoen karpetara seinalatu behar du."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Restart Peertube."
msgstr "Berrabiarazi PeerTube."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Start your debugger server."
msgstr "Abiarazi zure araztaile-zerbitzaria."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "For Prosody to connect to the debugger, call the API `http://your_instance.tld/plugins/livechat/router/api/restart_prosody?debugger=true`.  This call does not need any authentication.  It can be done from a command line, for example with `curl http://your_instance.tld/plugins/livechat/router/api/restart_prosody?debugger=true`.  You can even configure your debug server to launch this request automatically."
msgstr ""
"Prosody araztailera konekta dadin, deitu `http://your_instance.tld/plugins/"
"livechat/router/api/restart_prosody?debugger=true` APIari.  Dei honek ez du "
"autentifikaziorik behar.  Komando-lerrotik egin daiteke, adibidez `curl "
"http://your_instance.tld/plugins/livechat/router/api/"
"restart_prosody?debugger=true` erabiliz.  Zure arazketa-zerbitzaria ere "
"konfigura dezakezu eskaera hau automatikoki abiarazteko."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Prosody will then restart, connecting to the debugger."
msgstr "Ondoren, Prosody berrabiaraziko da, araztailera konektatuz."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick dev environment using Docker"
msgstr "Garapen-ingurune azkarra Docker erabiliz"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "There is a tutorial, in french, on the [Peertube forum](https://framacolibri.org/t/tutoriel-creer-un-environnement-de-developpement-de-plugin-peertube-rapidement-en-utilisant-docker-et-qui-permet-de-tester-la-federation/17631) that explains how to quickly build a dev env using Docker."
msgstr ""
"Tutorial bat dago, frantsesez, [PeerTuberen foroan](https://framacolibri.org/"
"t/tutoriel-creer-un-environnement-de-developpement-de-plugin-peertube-"
"rapidement-en-utilisant-docker-et-qui-permet-de-tester-la-federation/17631), "
"Docker erabiliz garapen-ingurune bat azkar nola sortu azaltzen duena."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "A repo was made out of it, check out [pt-plugin-dev](https://codeberg.org/mose/pt-plugin-dev)."
msgstr ""
"Hortik biltegi bat sortu zen; ikusi [pt-plugin-dev](https://codeberg.org/"
"mose/pt-plugin-dev)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "Note: for an unknown reason, Prosody can't resolve containers DNS address when using the lua-unbound library.  There is a dirty hack in the plugin: just create a `/data/plugins/data/peertube-plugin-livechat/no_lua_unbound` file in your docker-volumes, then restart containers."
msgstr ""
"Oharra: arrazoi ezezagun batengatik, Prosodyk ezin ditu edukiontzien DNS "
"helbideak ebatzi lua-unbound liburutegia erabiltzean.  Osagarrian konponbide "
"zikin bat dago: sortu `/data/plugins/data/peertube-plugin-livechat/"
"no_lua_unbound` fitxategi bat zure docker-volumes karpetan, eta berrabiarazi "
"edukiontziak."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quickly rebuild and install the plugin"
msgstr "Eraiki eta instalatu osagarria azkar"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "When you do modification, you don't have to always rebuild the full project, and reinstall the plugin on your dev environment.  You can build only the modified part (for example, if you only modified client files: `npm run build:client`).  Check the `package.json` files for available build scripts."
msgstr ""
"Aldaketak egiten dituzunean, ez duzu beti proiektu osoa berriz eraiki eta "
"osagarria zure garapen-ingurunean berriz instalatu behar.  Aldatutako zatia "
"soilik eraiki dezakezu (adibidez, bezero-fitxategiak soilik aldatu badituzu: "
"`npm run build:client`).  Begiratu `package.json` fitxategiak eskuragarri "
"dauden eraikitze-scriptak ikusteko."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "When the plugin is already installed on your dev instance, and you haven't changed any dependency, you can quickly install your work by following these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Osagarria zure garapen-instantzian instalatuta dagoenean eta mendekotasunik "
"aldatu ez baduzu, zure lana azkar instala dezakezu urrats hauek jarraituz:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "re-build necessary parts of the plugin (client, styles, ...),"
msgstr "berriz eraiki osagarriaren beharrezko zatiak (bezeroa, estiloak, ...),"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "overwrite the `data/plugins/node_modules/peertube-plugin-livechat/dist/` content of your dev instance by the content of the plugin's `dist` folder,"
msgstr ""
"gainidatzi zure garapen-instantziako `data/plugins/node_modules/peertube-"
"plugin-livechat/dist/` edukia osagarriaren `dist` karpetaren edukiarekin,"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "change recursively `plugins/node_modules/peertube-plugin-livechat/dist/` files owner to your `peertube` user,"
msgstr ""
"aldatu errekurtsiboki `plugins/node_modules/peertube-plugin-livechat/dist/` "
"fitxategien jabea zure `peertube` erabiltzailera,"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "restart your instance."
msgstr "berrabiarazi zure instantzia."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Performance tests"
msgstr "Errendimendu-probak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/develop/_index.md
msgid "The [livechat-perf-test](https://github.com/JohnXLivingston/livechat-perf-test) repository contains some tools to make performance tests.  It can be used to evaluate code improvements, or find bottlenecks."
msgstr ""
"[livechat-perf-test](https://github.com/JohnXLivingston/livechat-perf-test) "
"biltegiak errendimendu-probak egiteko tresna batzuk ditu.  Kodearen "
"hobekuntzak ebaluatzeko edo botila-lepoak aurkitzeko erabil daiteke."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Document the plugin, or translate the documentation."
msgstr "Dokumentatu osagarria, edo itzuli dokumentazioa."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentazioa"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "General information"
msgstr "Informazio orokorra"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "Always inform the community before working (by creating a new issue, or commenting an existing one).  This is to avoid that two persons are working on the same thing, and prevent conflicts."
msgstr ""
"Jakinarazi beti komunitateari lanean hasi aurretik (arazo-txosten berri bat "
"sortuz, edo lehendik dagoen bat iruzkinduz).  Horrela, bi pertsona gauza "
"berean aritzea eta gatazkak saihesten dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "Documentation work has to be merged in the `main` branch."
msgstr "Dokumentazio-lana `main` adarrean batu behar da."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "The documentation source code is in the `support/documentation/content` folder."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentazioaren iturburu-kodea `support/documentation/content` karpetan "
"dago."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "The documentation is generated using [Hugo](https://gohugo.io/).  You have to install it on your computer if you want to preview your work."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentazioa [Hugo](https://gohugo.io/) erabiliz sortzen da.  Zure "
"ordenagailuan instalatu behar duzu zure lana aurreikusi nahi baduzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "The minimum required version for Hugo is 0.121.0.  It was tested using version 0.132.2."
msgstr ""
"Hugoren gutxieneko bertsioa 0.121.0 da.  0.132.2 bertsioarekin probatu da."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "The used theme is [hugo-theme-relearn](https://mcshelby.github.io/hugo-theme-relearn).  You should read its documentation before starting editing the documentation."
msgstr ""
"Erabilitako gaia [hugo-theme-relearn](https://mcshelby.github.io/hugo-theme-"
"relearn) da.  Haren dokumentazioa irakurri beharko zenuke dokumentazioa "
"editatzen hasi aurretik."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "When a new plugin version is released, or when documentation is updated, plugin maintainers will merge the `main` branch to the `documentation` branch.  This will trigger github and gitlab pipelines, and update published documentation."
msgstr ""
"Osagarriaren bertsio berri bat argitaratzen denean, edo dokumentazioa "
"eguneratzen denean, osagarriaren mantentzaileek `main` adarra "
"`documentation` adarrean batuko dute.  Horrek GitHub eta GitLab "
"kanalizazioak abiaraziko ditu, eta argitaratutako dokumentazioa eguneratuko "
"du."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "Itzulpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "The principal language is english (`en` code)."
msgstr "Hizkuntza nagusia ingelesa da (`en` kodea)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "The `support/documentation/content/en` folder contains only english documentation files."
msgstr ""
"`support/documentation/content/en` karpetak ingelesezko dokumentazio-"
"fitxategiak baino ez ditu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "Documentation is translated using Weblate (see the [translation documentation](/peertube-plugin-livechat/contributing/translate/)).  To do so, we use the [po4a tool](https://po4a.org/), as we will se later in this page."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentazioa Weblate erabiliz itzultzen da (ikusi [itzulpenaren "
"dokumentazioa](/peertube-plugin-livechat/contributing/translate/)).  "
"Horretarako, [po4a tresna](https://po4a.org/) erabiltzen dugu, orri honetan "
"aurrerago ikusiko dugun bezala."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add a new language"
msgstr "Gehitu hizkuntza berri bat"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "In the `support/documentation/config.toml` file, please copy and modify the `[Languages.fr]` section."
msgstr ""
"`support/documentation/config.toml` fitxategian, kopiatu eta aldatu "
"`[Languages.fr]` atala."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "If the translations are not complete, it does not matter, english will be used for missing strings."
msgstr ""
"Itzulpenak osatu gabe badaude, ez du axola: falta diren kateetarako ingelesa "
"erabiliko da."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Aurrebista"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "To preview your modifications, just run:"
msgstr "Zure aldaketen aurrebista ikusteko, exekutatu hau besterik gabe:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "hugo serve -s support/documentation/\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "Then open your browser on the address [http://localhost:1313/peertube-plugin-livechat/](http://localhost:1313/peertube-plugin-livechat/).  This page will automatically refresh on each modification."
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, ireki zure nabigatzailea helbide honetan: [http://localhost:1313/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/](http://localhost:1313/peertube-plugin-livechat/)"
".  Orri hau automatikoki freskatuko da aldaketa bakoitzean."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update localization files and generate documentation translations"
msgstr "Eguneratu lokalizazio-fitxategiak eta sortu dokumentazioaren itzulpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "For now, you only have the english version.  To update documentation strings, and generate translations, you have to run the `doc-translate.sh` script."
msgstr ""
"Oraingoz, ingelesezko bertsioa baino ez duzu.  Dokumentazioaren kateak "
"eguneratzeko eta itzulpenak sortzeko, `doc-translate.sh` scripta exekutatu "
"behar duzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To do so, make sure you have `po4a` (version >= 0.69) installed on your computer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Horretarako, ziurtatu `po4a` (>= 0.69 bertsioa) instalatuta duzula zure "
"ordenagailuan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "Some linux distro (like Debian Bullseye for example) have too old version of `po4a`.  Please make sure to install a compatible version.  If you are using Debian Bullseye for example, you can download the Bookworm po4a.deb file from [https://packages.debian.org](https://packages.debian.org/bookworm/all/po4a/download), and install it manually."
msgstr ""
"Linux banaketa batzuek (Debian Bullseye, adibidez) `po4a`-ren bertsio "
"zaharregia dute.  Ziurtatu bertsio bateragarri bat instalatzen duzula.  "
"Debian Bullseye erabiltzen baduzu, adibidez, Bookworm-en po4a.deb fitxategia "
"deskarga dezakezu [https://packages.debian.org](https://packages.debian.org/"
"bookworm/all/po4a/download) helbidetik, eta eskuz instalatu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "To handle translations, just do:"
msgstr "Itzulpenak kudeatzeko, egin hau besterik gabe:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "npm run doc:translate\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "You can then preview the result using `hugo serve -s support/documentation/`, and using the language selector."
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, emaitzaren aurrebista ikus dezakezu `hugo serve -s support/"
"documentation/` erabiliz, eta hizkuntza-hautatzailea erabiliz."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Write documentation"
msgstr "Idatzi dokumentazioa"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "Just edit the english files in `support/documentation/content/en`."
msgstr ""
"Editatu `support/documentation/content/en` karpetako ingelesezko "
"fitxategiak, besterik ez."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "Then, before commiting, always run `npm run doc:translate`, so that changes in english files can be propagated to the `support/documentation/po/livechat.en.pot` file."
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, commit egin aurretik, exekutatu beti `npm run doc:translate`, "
"ingelesezko fitxategietako aldaketak `support/documentation/po/"
"livechat.en.pot` fitxategira zabal daitezen."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "You can use the `livechat_label` short code to use application strings.  See here: [Documentation translation](/peertube-plugin-livechat/contributing/translate/#documentation-translation)."
msgstr ""
"`livechat_label` kode laburra erabil dezakezu aplikazioaren kateak "
"erabiltzeko.  Ikusi hemen: [Dokumentazioaren itzulpena](/peertube-plugin-"
"livechat/contributing/translate/#documentation-translation)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "It is possible to prevent a file from beeing translating, using `livechatnotranslation: true` in the Yaml Font Matter section.  See here: [Documentation translation](/peertube-plugin-livechat/contributing/translate/#documentation-translation)."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi bat itzul ez dadin eragotz daiteke, Yaml Front Matter atalean "
"`livechatnotranslation: true` erabiliz.  Ikusi hemen: [Dokumentazioaren "
"itzulpena](/peertube-plugin-livechat/contributing/translate/#documentation-"
"translation)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "Please use the `livechatnotranslation` option for technical documentation.  We don't want technical documentation to be translated, to avoid issues because of a wrong translation."
msgstr ""
"Erabili `livechatnotranslation` aukera dokumentazio teknikorako.  Ez dugu "
"nahi dokumentazio teknikoa itzultzea, itzulpen oker batek eragin ditzakeen "
"arazoak saihesteko."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "To facilitate translators work, avoid making too long paragraphs."
msgstr "Itzultzaileen lana errazteko, saihestu paragrafo luzeegiak egitea."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "For now, it is not possible to use Markdown tables: the translation tools will break them."
msgstr ""
"Oraingoz, ezin da Markdown taularik erabili: itzulpen-tresnek hautsi egingo "
"lituzkete."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "There may be links to this documentation elsewhere on the web.  Try not to change the urls of the documentation pages.  Or at the very least, put links to the new location on the previous url."
msgstr ""
"Baliteke webeko beste leku batzuetan dokumentazio honetarako estekak "
"egotea.  Saiatu dokumentazio-orrien URLak ez aldatzen.  Edo, gutxienez, "
"jarri kokapen berrirako estekak aurreko URLan."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "When a new feature is released, you can use the `livechat_version_notice` short code to display an infobox with the version with which the features is available.  This short code takes the version number as parameter.  Here is an example:"
msgstr ""
"Eginbide berri bat argitaratzen denean, `livechat_version_notice` kode "
"laburra erabil dezakezu eginbidea zein bertsiotatik dagoen erabilgarri "
"adierazten duen informazio-koadro bat erakusteko.  Kode labur honek bertsio-"
"zenbakia hartzen du parametro gisa.  Hona hemen adibide bat:"

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What if I can't use hugo and/or po4a?"
msgstr "Eta hugo eta/edo po4a erabili ezin baditut?"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "Just edit english markdown files, and specify that you can't build translations when you make your Pull Request."
msgstr ""
"Editatu ingelesezko markdown fitxategiak, besterik ez, eta zehaztu "
"itzulpenak ezin dituzula eraiki zure Pull Requesta egitean."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Publication"
msgstr "Argitalpena"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/document/_index.md
msgid "Publishing the documentation is automatic, as soon as the changes are merged into the `documentation` branch."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentazioa automatikoki argitaratzen da, aldaketak `documentation` "
"adarrean batu bezain laster."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/feedback/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Give your feedback"
msgstr "Eman zure iritzia"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/feedback/_index.md
msgid "You don't need to know how to code to start contributing to this plugin! Other contributions are very valuable too, among which: you can test the software and report bugs, you can give feedback, features that you are interested in, user interface, design, ..."
msgstr ""
"Ez duzu programatzen jakin behar osagarri honetan laguntzen hasteko! Beste "
"ekarpen batzuk ere oso baliotsuak dira, besteak beste: softwarea probatu eta "
"akatsen berri eman dezakezu, zure iritzia eman, interesatzen zaizkizun "
"eginbideak, erabiltzaile-interfazea, diseinua, ..."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Lagundu"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/_index.md
msgid "Interested in contributing? Awesome!"
msgstr "Laguntzeko interesa duzu? Bikain!"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translate the plugin"
msgstr "Itzuli osagarria"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Itzuli"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "You can contribute to this plugin translation.  Translations are handled using the [Weblate](https://weblate.org/) software, using [Framasoft Weblate instance](https://weblate.framasoft.org/)."
msgstr ""
"Osagarri honen itzulpenean lagun dezakezu.  Itzulpenak [Weblate](https://"
"weblate.org/) softwarearekin kudeatzen dira, [Framasoften Weblate instantzia]"
"(https://weblate.framasoft.org/) erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Never modify directly files in the `languages` folder, this could lead to conflicts."
msgstr ""
"Ez aldatu inoiz zuzenean `languages` karpetako fitxategiak; gatazkak sor "
"ditzake."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to"
msgstr "Nola egin"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Create an account: https://weblate.framasoft.org/accounts/register/"
msgstr "Sortu kontu bat: https://weblate.framasoft.org/accounts/register/"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Validate your email and follow the link sent"
msgstr "Baliozkotu zure helbide elektronikoa eta jarraitu bidalitako esteka"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Create your password and setup your account"
msgstr "Sortu zure pasahitza eta konfiguratu zure kontua"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Go to the plugin project page: https://weblate.framasoft.org/projects/peertube-livechat/peertube-plugin-livechat/"
msgstr ""
"Joan osagarriaren proiektu-orrira: https://weblate.framasoft.org/projects/"
"peertube-livechat/peertube-plugin-livechat/"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Choose the locale you want to translate"
msgstr "Aukeratu itzuli nahi duzun hizkuntza"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Just translate missing sentences, or correct the ones that seems incorrect to you."
msgstr "Itzuli falta diren esaldiak, edo zuzendu oker iruditzen zaizkizunak."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "There might be some «very technical» strings. If you are not 100% sure of the meaning, or of your translation, you better not translate it, so it will display in english."
msgstr ""
"Baliteke kate «oso tekniko» batzuk egotea. Haien esanahiaz edo zure "
"itzulpenaz % 100 ziur ez bazaude, hobe da ez itzultzea; horrela, ingelesez "
"agertuko dira."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ConverseJS translations"
msgstr "ConverseJSren itzulpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "This plugin relies on [ConverseJS](https://conversejs.org/) for the chat front-end.  ConverseJS has its own translations, on its own [weblate instance](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/conversejs/#languages).  You can also translate directly in the code repository.  For more information, check [ConverseJS translations documentation](https://conversejs.org/docs/html/translations.html)."
msgstr ""
"Osagarri honek [ConverseJS](https://conversejs.org/) erabiltzen du txataren "
"front-endarako.  ConverseJSk bere itzulpenak ditu, bere [Weblate instantzian]"
"(https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/conversejs/#languages).  Kode-biltegian "
"zuzenean ere itzul dezakezu.  Informazio gehiagorako, ikusi [ConverseJSren "
"itzulpenen dokumentazioa](https://conversejs.org/docs/html/translations.html)"
"."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding a new locale"
msgstr "Gehitu hizkuntza berri bat"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "If you think there is a missing locale, please check first if it is handled in Peertube.  If so, you can [open an issue](https://github.com/JohnXLivingston/peertube-plugin-livechat/issues) to ask for it."
msgstr ""
"Hizkuntzaren bat falta dela uste baduzu, egiaztatu lehenik PeerTuben "
"kudeatzen den.  Hala bada, [arazo-txosten bat ireki](https://github.com/"
"JohnXLivingston/peertube-plugin-livechat/issues) dezakezu eskatzeko."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding new strings / use translations in the code"
msgstr "Kate berriak gehitu / itzulpenak kodean erabili"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "If you are working on new features, and need new strings, you can create them directly in Weblate.  The english version is mandatory. Start with it."
msgstr ""
"Eginbide berrietan ari bazara eta kate berriak behar badituzu, zuzenean "
"Weblaten sor ditzakezu.  Ingelesezko bertsioa derrigorrezkoa da. Hasi "
"harekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Each string is linked to a key (for example `use_chat`).  Choose an explicit key in english, lower case."
msgstr ""
"Kate bakoitza gako bati lotuta dago (adibidez, `use_chat`).  Aukeratu gako "
"esplizitu bat ingelesez, letra xehez."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "If you have to test new strings without waiting for a Weblate merge, you can modify `languages/*.yml` files, but avoid to commit these changes (to minimize conflict risks)."
msgstr ""
"Kate berriak Weblateko batzea itxaron gabe probatu behar badituzu, "
"`languages/*.yml` fitxategiak alda ditzakezu, baina saihestu aldaketa horien "
"commita egitea (gatazka-arriskuak murrizteko)."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use translations in front-end code"
msgstr "Erabili itzulpenak front-end kodean"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Before using a string in front-end, you need to declare a new constant in `client/@types/global.d.ts`.  The constant name must:"
msgstr ""
"Front-endean kate bat erabili aurretik, konstante berri bat deklaratu behar "
"duzu `client/@types/global.d.ts` fitxategian.  Konstantearen izenak:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "start with the prefix \"LOC_\""
msgstr "\"LOC_\" aurrizkiarekin hasi behar du"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "use the string key, upper cased"
msgstr "katearen gakoa erabili behar du, letra larriz"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "you just have to declare its type, not its value"
msgstr "haren mota deklaratu besterik ez duzu egin behar, ez haren balioa"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "For example, to use \"use_chat\", you have to declare:"
msgstr "Adibidez, \"use_chat\" erabiltzeko, hau deklaratu behar duzu:"

#. type: Fenced code block (typescript)
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "declare const LOC_USE_CHAT: string\n"
msgstr "declare const LOC_USE_CHAT: string\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "The `build-client.js` script will read the `client/@types/global.d.ts`, search for such constants, and load their values from the languages files."
msgstr ""
"`build-client.js` scriptak `client/@types/global.d.ts` irakurriko du, "
"horrelako konstanteak bilatu, eta haien balioak hizkuntza-fitxategietatik "
"kargatuko ditu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Now, you can simply call `peertubeHelpers.translate(LOC_USE_CHAT)` in your code."
msgstr ""
"Orain, `peertubeHelpers.translate(LOC_USE_CHAT)` dei dezakezu zure kodean, "
"besterik gabe."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use translations in back-end code"
msgstr "Erabili itzulpenak back-end kodean"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "In theory, the only parts of the backend code where you need localization is the settings declaration and standardized data (ActivityPub, RSS, ...).  Here we need to get english strings from the translation key."
msgstr ""
"Teorian, backend kodean lokalizazioa behar duzun zati bakarrak ezarpenen "
"deklarazioa eta datu estandarizatuak dira (ActivityPub, RSS, ...).  Hemen, "
"ingelesezko kateak lortu behar ditugu itzulpen-gakotik."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Note: you should never need another language translation from backend code.  Localization must be done on front-end."
msgstr ""
"Oharra: ez zenuke inoiz behar beste hizkuntza bateko itzulpenik backend "
"kodetik.  Lokalizazioa front-endean egin behar da."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "There is a `lib/loc.ts` module providing a `loc()` function.  Just pass it the key to have the english string: `loc('diagnostic')`'."
msgstr ""
"`lib/loc.ts` modulu bat dago, `loc()` funtzio bat eskaintzen duena.  Pasatu "
"gakoa ingelesezko katea lortzeko: `loc('diagnostic')`'."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Documentation translation"
msgstr "Dokumentazioaren itzulpena"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "The documentation translation is done using the corresponding Weblate component."
msgstr "Dokumentazioaren itzulpena dagokion Weblate osagaiaren bidez egiten da."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "There is a specific \"Hugo shortcodes\" you can use to display an application string.  Saying you want to display the name of the button \"open_chat_new_window\", you can use this in the documentation markdown file:"
msgstr ""
"\"Hugo kode labur\" berezi bat dago aplikazioaren kate bat erakusteko.  "
"Demagun \"open_chat_new_window\" botoiaren izena erakutsi nahi duzula; hau "
"erabil dezakezu dokumentazioaren markdown fitxategian:"

#. type: Fenced code block (hugo)
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "{{%/* livechat_label open_chat_new_window */%}}\n"
msgstr "{{%/* livechat_label open_chat_new_window */%}}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "You can also prevent a whole page from being translating by adding `livechatnotranslation: true` in the Yaml Font Matter section:"
msgstr ""
"Orri oso bat itzul ez dadin ere eragotz dezakezu, Yaml Front Matter atalean "
"`livechatnotranslation: true` gehituz:"

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  ---\n"
"  title: \"Third party\"\n"
"  description: \"Displaying the livechat with 3rd party software.\"\n"
"  weight: 20\n"
"  chapter: false\n"
"  livechatnotranslation: true\n"
"  ---\n"
msgstr ""
"  ---\n"
"  title: \"Third party\"\n"
"  description: \"Displaying the livechat with 3rd party software.\"\n"
"  weight: 20\n"
"  chapter: false\n"
"  livechatnotranslation: true\n"
"  ---\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Never translate a string in the `livechat.en.pot` file, it would be ignored.  Instead, edit directly the markdown files."
msgstr ""
"Ez itzuli inoiz katerik `livechat.en.pot` fitxategian; ez litzateke kontuan "
"hartuko.  Horren ordez, editatu zuzenean markdown fitxategiak."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "If a string contains a link, you can change it for the correct link in the translated language.  For example, for a link to this documentation, you can add the language code in the url."
msgstr ""
"Kate batek esteka bat badu, itzulitako hizkuntzako esteka zuzenarekin ordez "
"dezakezu.  Adibidez, dokumentazio honetarako esteka batean, hizkuntza-kodea "
"gehi dezakezu URLan."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Some strings are block of code.  Don't translate code.  But you can translate comments, or parameters if relevant."
msgstr ""
"Kate batzuk kode-blokeak dira.  Ez itzuli kodea.  Baina iruzkinak edo "
"parametroak itzul ditzakezu, egokia bada."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "If you are not sure, just don't translate, and ask what to do."
msgstr "Ziur ez bazaude, ez itzuli, eta galdetu zer egin."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "The tool I use to handle translations for the documentation can have strange behaviours. When I add sentences that looks like other existing sentences, it sometimes copies existing translations. So, when you have translations marked as \"to check\", please make sure it doesn't copy a string that has nothing to do with the english one before validating."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentazioaren itzulpenak kudeatzeko erabiltzen dudan tresnak portaera "
"arraroak izan ditzake. Lehendik dauden beste esaldi batzuen antzeko esaldiak "
"gehitzen ditudanean, batzuetan lehendik dauden itzulpenak kopiatzen ditu. "
"Beraz, \"egiaztatzeko\" markatutako itzulpenak dituzunean, ziurtatu "
"ingelesezkoarekin zerikusirik ez duen katerik kopiatu ez duela baliozkotu "
"aurretik."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "If you are now sure about the context of a string, you can check the string location in the weblate's right pane, and open the corresponding documentation page.  For example, for a string located in the file `support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers.md`, the corresponding url is `https://livingston.frama.io/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/`."
msgstr ""
"Kate baten testuinguruaz ziur ez bazaude, katearen kokapena begira dezakezu "
"Weblateko eskuineko panelean, eta dagokion dokumentazio-orria ireki.  "
"Adibidez, `support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers.md` "
"fitxategian dagoen kate baterako, dagokion URLa `https://livingston.frama.io/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/` da."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generic recommandations"
msgstr "Gomendio orokorrak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/contributing/translate/_index.md
msgid "Please be inclusive in your wordings, and please respect the [code of coduct](/peertube-plugin-livechat/contributing/codeofconduct/)."
msgstr ""
"Erabili hizkera inklusiboa, eta errespetatu [jokabide-kodea](/peertube-"
"plugin-livechat/contributing/codeofconduct/)."

