msgstr ""
"{{% livechat_label avatar_set_option_legacy %}}: [David Revoyren lanean]"
"(https://www.davidrevoy.com) oinarritua, [AGPL-v3](https://www.gnu.org/"
"licenses/agpl-3.0.en.html) lizentzia"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "![Legacy avatar example](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/avatar_legacy.jpg?classes=shadow,border&height=40px \"Legacy\")"
msgstr ""
"![Abatar zaharraren adibidea](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"avatar_legacy.jpg?classes=shadow,border&height=40px \"Zaharra\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "If you can't see the change immediatly, it could be because of your browser cache. Just clear your browser session storage, or restart it."
msgstr ""
"Aldaketa berehala ikusten ez baduzu, baliteke zure nabigatzailearen "
"cachearen ondorioz izatea. Garbitu zure nabigatzailearen saio-biltegia, edo "
"berrabiarazi."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "You can choose which theme to use for ConverseJS:"
msgstr "ConverseJSrako zein gai erabili aukera dezakezu:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "Peertube theme: this is a special theme, made especially for peertube's integration."
msgstr ""
"PeerTube gaia: gai berezi bat da, PeerTuben integratzeko berariaz egina."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "Default ConverseJS theme: this is the default ConverseJS theme."
msgstr "ConverseJS gai lehenetsia: ConverseJSren gai lehenetsia da."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "ConverseJS cyberpunk theme: this is a theme provided by ConverseJS."
msgstr "ConverseJS cyberpunk gaia: ConverseJSk eskaintzen duen gai bat da."

#. type: Title ##
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat server advanced settings"
msgstr "Txat-zerbitzariaren ezarpen aurreratuak"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "The plugin comes with an AppImage that is used to run the [Prosody XMPP server](https://prosody.im).  If this AppImage is not working, you can fallback to the Prosody that is packaged for your server. Just install the `prosody` package."
msgstr ""
"Osagarriak AppImage bat dakar, [Prosody XMPP zerbitzaria](https://"
"prosody.im) exekutatzeko erabiltzen dena.  AppImage honek ez badu "
"funtzionatzen, zure zerbitzarirako paketatutako Prosody erabil dezakezu. "
"Instalatu `prosody` paketea, besterik ez."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "This setting should only be used if the plugin is broken, and waiting for a patch."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen hau osagarria hautsita dagoenean eta adabaki baten zain dagoenean "
"soilik erabili beharko litzateke."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If this setting is left empty, and you are using Peertube >= 5.1 or later, the plugin will use values from your Peertube configuration file to guess on which interface and port request have to be done.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen hau hutsik uzten bada eta PeerTube >= 5.1 edo berriagoa erabiltzen "
"baduzu, osagarriak zure PeerTube konfigurazio-fitxategiko balioak erabiliko "
"ditu eskaerak zein interfaze eta atakatan egin behar diren asmatzeko.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "In last resort, it will use your Peertube public URI.  So, any API Call will go throught your Nginx server.  This could fail in some case: for example if you are in a Docker container, where the public hostname does not resolve to the correct IP.  In such case, try changing the \"{{% livechat_label prosody_peertube_uri_label %}}\" settings, by setting `http://127.0.0.1:9000` (assuming 9000 is the port on which Peertube listen, ask your instance administrators if you don't know)."
msgstr ""
"Azken aukera gisa, zure PeerTuberen URI publikoa erabiliko du.  Beraz, API "
"dei guztiak zure Nginx zerbitzaritik pasatuko dira.  Horrek huts egin dezake "
"kasu batzuetan: adibidez, Docker edukiontzi batean bazaude, eta ostalari-"
"izen publikoa ez bada IP zuzenera ebazten.  Kasu horretan, saiatu \"{{% "
"livechat_label prosody_peertube_uri_label %}}\" ezarpena aldatzen, `http://"
"127.0.0.1:9000` ezarriz (9000 PeerTubek entzuten duen ataka dela suposatuz; "
"galdetu zure instantziako administratzaileei ez badakizu)."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "This setting enable XMPP clients to connect to the built-in Prosody server.  For now, this option **only allows connections from localhost clients**."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen honek XMPP bezeroei barneko Prosody zerbitzarira konektatzeko aukera "
"ematen die.  Oraingoz, aukera honek **localhost bezeroen konexioak soilik "
"baimentzen ditu**."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "As example, this option can allow an instance of Matterbridge (once it could use anonymous login) *on the same machine* to bridge your chat with another services like a Matrix room."
msgstr ""
"Adibidez, aukera honi esker Matterbridge instantzia bat (saio-hasiera "
"anonimoa erabil dezakeenean) *makina berean* zure txata beste zerbitzu "
"batzuekin (Matrix gela bat, adibidez) zubitzeko gai izan daiteke."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "This setting enable XMPP external components to connect to the server.  By default, this option **only allows connections from localhost components**.  You have to change the \"{{% livechat_label prosody_components_interfaces_label %}}\" value to listen on other network interfaces."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen honek kanpoko XMPP osagaiei zerbitzarira konektatzeko aukera ematen "
"die.  Lehenespenez, aukera honek **localhost osagaien konexioak soilik "
"baimentzen ditu**.  \"{{% livechat_label prosody_components_interfaces_label "
"%}}\" balioa aldatu behar duzu beste sare-interfaze batzuetan entzuteko."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "This feature could be used to connect bridges or bots."
msgstr "Eginbide hau zubiak edo botak konektatzeko erabil liteke."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "More informations on Prosody external components [here](https://prosody.im/doc/components)."
msgstr ""
"Prosodyren kanpoko osagaiei buruzko informazio gehiago [hemen](https://"
"prosody.im/doc/components)."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/admin/settings.md
msgid "For more information, please check [the documentation](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/admin/mod_firewall/)."
msgstr ""
"Informazio gehiagorako, ikusi [dokumentazioa](/peertube-plugin-livechat/"
"documentation/admin/mod_firewall/)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plugin documentation"
msgstr "Osagarriaren dokumentazioa"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For now, the plugin only works out of the box for x86_64 and arm64 CPU architecture. Here are some instructions for other CPU architectures."
msgstr ""
"Oraingoz, osagarriak x86_64 eta arm64 PUZ arkitekturetan soilik "
"funtzionatzen du zuzenean. Hona hemen beste PUZ arkitektura batzuetarako "
"argibide batzuk."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Known issues: CPU Compatibility"
msgstr "Arazo ezagunak: PUZ bateragarritasuna"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "The Prosody AppImage included in the plugin will only work on x86_64 and arm64 CPU.  It is not compatible with other CPU architectures."
msgstr ""
"Osagarrian sartutako Prosody AppImageak x86_64 eta arm64 PUZetan soilik "
"funtzionatuko du.  Ez da bateragarria beste PUZ arkitektura batzuekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "To use the plugin, you will have to manually install Prosody on your server (see below)."
msgstr ""
"Osagarria erabiltzeko, Prosody eskuz instalatu beharko duzu zure "
"zerbitzarian (ikusi behean)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note: the plugin requires Prosody >= 0.12.0.\n"
"If you are using an older version, Chat Federation could be broken, and it could have some unexpected behaviour.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oharra: osagarriak Prosody >= 0.12.0 behar du.\n"
"Bertsio zaharrago bat erabiltzen baduzu, txat-federazioa hautsita egon "
"daiteke, eta ezusteko portaera batzuk izan ditzake.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "Once it is done, you have to check `Use system Prosody` in the plugin settings."
msgstr ""
"Hori egin ondoren, `Use system Prosody` markatu behar duzu osagarriaren "
"ezarpenetan."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On non-docker Peertube installation"
msgstr "Docker gabeko PeerTube instalazioan"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "For standard installation, you just have to install the official `prosody` package for your linux distribution."
msgstr ""
"Instalazio estandarrean, zure Linux banaketarako `prosody` pakete ofiziala "
"instalatu besterik ez duzu egin behar."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "For example, on Debian/Ubuntu:"
msgstr "Adibidez, Debian/Ubuntun:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo apt install prosody\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "You can then disable the service that starts automatically when you install Prosody (the plugin will launch a Prosody process, there is no need for the service to run).  For example, on Debian/Ubuntu (and other Systemd based linux distributions):"
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, Prosody instalatzean automatikoki abiarazten den zerbitzua desgai "
"dezakezu (osagarriak Prosody prozesu bat abiaraziko du; ez da beharrezkoa "
"zerbitzua exekutatzea).  Adibidez, Debian/Ubuntun (eta Systemd-n "
"oinarritutako beste Linux banaketa batzuetan):"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo systemctl disable prosody && sudo systemctl stop prosody\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "Warning: do not disable Prosody if it is used for another service on your server, like for example Jitsi."
msgstr ""
"Kontuz: ez desgaitu Prosody zure zerbitzariko beste zerbitzu baterako "
"erabiltzen bada, Jitsirako adibidez."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "You will have to generate a Peertube image that includes Prosody in the same container that Peertube.  I know this is not the standard way to do this with Docker, but keep in mind it is a temporary workaround."
msgstr ""
"Prosody PeerTuberen edukiontzi berean duen PeerTube irudi bat sortu beharko "
"duzu.  Badakit hori ez dela Dockerrekin egiteko modu estandarra, baina "
"kontuan izan aldi baterako konponbidea dela."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "To generate and use such an image, please refer to the Docker documentation.  The Docker file to generate the image should be:"
msgstr ""
"Horrelako irudi bat sortu eta erabiltzeko, ikusi Dockerren dokumentazioa.  "
"Irudia sortzeko Docker fitxategiak hau izan beharko luke:"

#. type: Fenced code block (Docker)
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"FROM chocobozzz/peertube:production-bullseye\n"
"\n"
"RUN apt -y update && apt install -y prosody && apt -y clean\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Yunohost"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "You have to disable `metronome` (the XMPP server provided by Yunohost), and install `prosody`."
msgstr ""
"`metronome` (Yunohostek eskaintzen duen XMPP zerbitzaria) desgaitu eta "
"`prosody` instalatu behar duzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "This is already done by the Yunohost Peertube application, as it was required for the plugin before the v6.0.0."
msgstr ""
"Hori dagoeneko egiten du Yunohosten PeerTube aplikazioak, osagarriak v6.0.0 "
"bertsioaren aurretik behar baitzuen."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/cpu_compatibility.md
msgid "But it may be removed in a near feature (to avoid drawbacks of this method).  I have to discuss with Yunohost team, to decide how we can do to minimize drawbacks, and maximize compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Baina baliteke etorkizun hurbilean kentzea (metodo honen eragozpenak "
"saihesteko).  Yunohost taldearekin eztabaidatu behar dut, eragozpenak "
"gutxitzeko eta bateragarritasuna ahalik eta handiena izateko zer egin "
"dezakegun erabakitzeko."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plugin peertube-plugin-livechat installation guide"
msgstr "peertube-plugin-livechat osagarriaren instalazio-gida"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation guide"
msgstr "Instalazio-gida"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/_index.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/_index.md
msgid "Before updating to a major release, please read the release notes and breaking changes list : [CHANGELOG](https://github.com/JohnXLivingston/peertube-plugin-livechat/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)."
msgstr ""
"Bertsio nagusi batera eguneratu aurretik, irakurri bertsio-oharrak eta "
"aldaketa hausleen zerrenda: [CHANGELOG](https://github.com/JohnXLivingston/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/_index.md
msgid "To install or update the plugin, **just use the Peertube web admin interface**."
msgstr ""
"Osagarria instalatzeko edo eguneratzeko, **erabili PeerTuberen web bidezko "
"administrazio-interfazea, besterik ez**."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/_index.md
msgid "Here are some other more specific instructions:"
msgstr "Hona hemen beste argibide zehatzago batzuk:"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some classic mistakes and workarounds."
msgstr "Ohiko akats batzuk eta haien konponbideak."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "I just installed/upgraded the plugin, but nothing happens"
msgstr "Osagarria instalatu/eguneratu berri dut, baina ez da ezer gertatzen"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "If you have just installed/upgraded the plugin, but nothing happens (no chat, no settings, buttons in the settings page does not work, ...), just try to reload the page."
msgstr ""
"Osagarria instalatu/eguneratu berri baduzu, baina ez bada ezer gertatzen "
"(txatik ez, ezarpenik ez, ezarpen-orriko botoiek ez dute funtzionatzen, ...)"
", saiatu orria birkargatzen."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Diagnostic tool"
msgstr "Diagnostiko-tresna"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "If the chat does not work, there is a diagnostic tool in the plugin's settings pages."
msgstr ""
"Txatak funtzionatzen ez badu, diagnostiko-tresna bat dago osagarriaren "
"ezarpen-orrietan."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Open the plugin settings, and click on the \"launch diagnostic\" button."
msgstr ""
"Ireki osagarriaren ezarpenak, eta egin klik \"abiarazi diagnostikoa\" "
"botoian."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the plugin's settings page, with a \"launch diagnostic\" button.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/launch_diagnostic.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Launch diagnostic\")"
msgstr ""
"![Osagarriaren ezarpen-orriaren pantaila-argazkia, \"abiarazi diagnostikoa\" "
"botoiarekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"launch_diagnostic.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Abiarazi "
"diagnostikoa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "If there is any error in the diagnostic page, you can search in this page for a solution, or refer to the [Bug tracking documentation page](/peertube-plugin-livechat/issues/) if you can't find any response."
msgstr ""
"Diagnostiko-orrian erroreren bat badago, orri honetan bila dezakezu "
"konponbide bat, edo ikusi [Akatsen jarraipenaren dokumentazio-orria](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/issues/) erantzunik aurkitzen ez baduzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the diagnostic result page. This gives a lot of information, with status for different test suites.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/diagnostic.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Diagnostic result\")"
msgstr ""
"![Diagnostikoaren emaitza-orriaren pantaila-argazkia. Informazio asko ematen "
"du, proba-sorta desberdinen egoerarekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"diagnostic.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Diagnostikoaren "
"emaitza\")"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat does not load"
msgstr "Txata ez da kargatzen"

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Internal API calls"
msgstr "Barneko API deiak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In some case (like for some Docker Peertube installation), the diagnostic tools displays an error for the test called \"API Prosody -> Peertube is KO\".\n"
msgstr ""
"Kasu batzuetan (Docker bidezko PeerTube instalazio batzuetan, adibidez), "
"diagnostiko-tresnak errore bat erakusten du \"API Prosody -> Peertube is "
"KO\" izeneko probarako.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "In such case, try changing the \"{{% livechat_label prosody_peertube_uri_label %}}\" settings, by setting `http://127.0.0.1:9000` (assuming 9000 is the port on which Peertube listen, ask your instance administrators if you don't know)."
msgstr ""
"Kasu horretan, saiatu \"{{% livechat_label prosody_peertube_uri_label %}}\" "
"ezarpena aldatzen, `http://127.0.0.1:9000` ezarriz (9000 PeerTubek entzuten "
"duen ataka dela suposatuz; galdetu zure instantziako administratzaileei ez "
"badakizu)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "Check the help for [this setting](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/admin/settings/) for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ikusi [ezarpen honen](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/admin/"
"settings/) laguntza informazio gehiagorako."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Websocket"
msgstr "Websocket"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "If everything is fine in the diagnostic tools, but chat windows remains empty: it can be a Websocket issue.  Since Peertube version 5.0.0, there are some additional configuration to do on the server side.  Check with the instance administrators that they did not forgot to apply changes listed in the [Peertube v5.0.0 release notes](https://github.com/Chocobozzz/PeerTube/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#v500)."
msgstr ""
"Diagnostiko-tresnetan dena ondo badago, baina txat-leihoa hutsik geratzen "
"bada: Websocket arazo bat izan daiteke.  PeerTube 5.0.0 bertsiotik, "
"konfigurazio gehigarri batzuk egin behar dira zerbitzariaren aldean.  "
"Egiaztatu instantziako administratzaileekin [PeerTube v5.0.0 bertsio-"
"oharretan](https://github.com/Chocobozzz/PeerTube/blob/master/"
"CHANGELOG.md#v500) zerrendatutako aldaketak aplikatzea ahaztu ez dutela."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "You can confirm that it is a Websocket issue by opening your browser console, and checking for error logs talking about failed Websocket connection."
msgstr ""
"Websocket arazo bat dela baiezta dezakezu zure nabigatzailearen kontsola "
"irekiz, eta huts egindako Websocket konexioei buruzko errore-erregistroak "
"bilatuz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/troubleshooting.md
msgid "If you can't fix this immediatly, you can disable Websocket by unchecking \"{{% livechat_label disable_websocket_label %}}\" in the plugin setting page.  In such case, you should also check \"{{% livechat_label federation_dont_publish_remotely_label %}}\", as chat federation won't work without Websocket."
msgstr ""
"Hau berehala konpondu ezin baduzu, Websocket desgai dezakezu osagarriaren "
"ezarpen-orrian \"{{% livechat_label disable_websocket_label %}}\" "
"desmarkatuz.  Kasu horretan, \"{{% livechat_label "
"federation_dont_publish_remotely_label %}}\" ere markatu beharko zenuke, "
"txat-federazioak ez baitu funtzionatuko Websocket gabe."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/upgrade_before_6.0.0.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Important notes when upgrading for an older version."
msgstr "Ohar garrantzitsuak bertsio zaharrago batetik eguneratzean."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/upgrade_before_6.0.0.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade from version older than 6.0.0"
msgstr "6.0.0 baino zaharragoa den bertsio batetik eguneratzea"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/upgrade_before_6.0.0.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "IMPORTANT NOTE"
msgstr "OHAR GARRANTZITSUA"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/upgrade_before_6.0.0.md
msgid "Since version v6.0.0, this plugin does not need any Prosody installation."
msgstr "v6.0.0 bertsiotik, osagarri honek ez du Prosody instalaziorik behar."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/upgrade_before_6.0.0.md
msgid "If you were using this plugin before this version, and if you had installed Prosody manually, you can safely uninstall Prosody."
msgstr ""
"Bertsio honen aurretik osagarri hau erabiltzen bazenuen eta Prosody eskuz "
"instalatu bazenuen, Prosody desinstala dezakezu arriskurik gabe."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/installation/upgrade_before_6.0.0.md
msgid "If you were using the custom Peertube docker image that is embedding Prosody, you can switch back to the official Peertube image."
msgstr ""
"Prosody barnean zuen PeerTube docker irudi pertsonalizatua erabiltzen "
"bazenuen, PeerTuberen irudi ofizialera itzul zaitezke."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plugin peertube-plugin-livechat user documentation"
msgstr "peertube-plugin-livechat osagarriaren erabiltzaile-dokumentazioa"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "User documentation"
msgstr "Erabiltzaile-dokumentazioa"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Documentation to stream the chat content using OBS."
msgstr "Txataren edukia OBS erabiliz igortzeko dokumentazioa."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "OBS"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "[OBS](https://obsproject.com) is a popular Free And Open Source streaming software, with advanced capacities for your live streams.  In the current page, you will find some advices to handle your live chats using OBS."
msgstr ""
"[OBS](https://obsproject.com) igorpen-software libre eta kode irekiko "
"ezaguna da, zure zuzeneko igorpenetarako gaitasun aurreratuak dituena.  Orri "
"honetan, zure zuzeneko txatak OBS erabiliz kudeatzeko aholku batzuk "
"aurkituko dituzu."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "OBS Overlay"
msgstr "OBS gainjartzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "You can easily include the chat in your video stream."
msgstr "Txata erraz sar dezakezu zure bideo-igorpenean."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a Peertube live, replay, with the chat included at the bottom of the video stream.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/embed_chat_in_livestream.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Embeding the chat in a live stream\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTube zuzeneko baten errepikapenaren pantaila-argazkia, txata bideo-"
"igorpenaren behealdean sartuta duela.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"embed_chat_in_livestream.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Txata "
"zuzeneko igorpen batean txertatzea\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "You can use the \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" feature to generate an URL to your chat.  This button should be near the chat if you are the video owner (unless it was desactivated by your server admins)."
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" eginbidea erabil dezakezu zure "
"txaterako URL bat sortzeko.  Botoi hau txataren ondoan egon beharko "
"litzateke bideoaren jabea bazara (zure zerbitzariko administratzaileek "
"desaktibatu ez badute behintzat)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "Check the \"{{% livechat_label read_only %}}\" checkbox in the modal."
msgstr ""
"Markatu \"{{% livechat_label read_only %}}\" kontrol-laukia leiho modalean."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" dialog, where the \"{{% livechat_label read_only %}}\" option is checked.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/share_readonly.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Share link popup\")"
msgstr ""
"![\"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" elkarrizketa-koadroaren "
"pantaila-argazkia, \"{{% livechat_label read_only %}}\" aukera markatuta "
"duela.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"share_readonly.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Partekatu esteka "
"leihoa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "Then use this link as a \"web browser source\" in OBS."
msgstr "Ondoren, erabili esteka hau \"web-nabigatzaile iturburu\" gisa OBSn."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the OBS software, where the chat was added as web browser source.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/embed_chat_in_obs.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Embeding the chat in OBS\")"
msgstr ""
"![OBS softwarearen pantaila-argazkia, txata web-nabigatzaile iturburu gisa "
"gehituta duela.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"embed_chat_in_obs.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Txata OBSn "
"txertatzea\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "You can use the \"{{% livechat_label transparent_background %}}\" option to have a transparent background in OBS.  If you want to customize the background transparency, you can add this CSS in your OBS browser source's settings:"
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label transparent_background %}}\" aukera erabil dezakezu "
"OBSn atzeko plano gardena izateko.  Atzeko planoaren gardentasuna "
"pertsonalizatu nahi baduzu, CSS hau gehi dezakezu zure OBS nabigatzaile-"
"iturburuaren ezarpenetan:"

#. type: Fenced code block (css)
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
":root {\n"
"  --livechat-transparent: rgba(255 255 255 / 90%) !important;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "In the previous CSS snippet, you can of course change the color or the transparency, by adapting the color values."
msgstr ""
"Aurreko CSS zatian, jakina, kolorea edo gardentasuna alda ditzakezu, kolore-"
"balioak egokituz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "Note: you can entirely customize chat colors. This is undocumented yet, but you can try this: in the modal, check «use curent theme colors», then you can try to manually change color values in the URL.  You must use valid CSS color values, and they must be properly URL encoded."
msgstr ""
"Oharra: txataren koloreak guztiz pertsonaliza ditzakezu. Hau ez dago "
"oraindik dokumentatuta, baina hau proba dezakezu: leiho modalean, markatu «"
"erabili uneko gaiaren koloreak», eta ondoren saiatu URLko kolore-balioak "
"eskuz aldatzen.  CSS kolore-balio baliozkoak erabili behar dituzu, eta behar "
"bezala URL kodetuta egon behar dute."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "OBS Dock"
msgstr "OBS panela"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "This feature can be disabled by the instance's adminitrators."
msgstr "Eginbide hau instantziako administratzaileek desgai dezakete."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "You can use OBS \"Custom browser docks\" to integrate the chat in your OBS while you are streaming.  The livechat plugin offers a way to create long term token that can identify you automatically to join the chat, so you don't have to enter your password in OBS."
msgstr ""
"OBSren \"Nabigatzaile-panel pertsonalizatuak\" erabil ditzakezu txata zure "
"OBSn integratzeko igortzen ari zaren bitartean.  Livechat osagarriak txatera "
"sartzeko automatikoki identifikatzen zaituen iraupen luzeko token bat "
"sortzeko modua eskaintzen du; beraz, ez duzu zure pasahitza OBSn sartu "
"beharrik."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "To do so, just use the \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" feature, and open the \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_dock %}}\" tab.  From there, you can create a new token using the \"+\" button."
msgstr ""
"Horretarako, erabili \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" eginbidea, "
"eta ireki \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_dock %}}\" fitxa.  Hortik, token "
"berri bat sor dezakezu \"+\" botoia erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" dialog, on the \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_dock %}} tab. A token was generated, and is selectionable.\"](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/share_dock.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Share link popup - dock tab\")"
msgstr ""
"![\"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" elkarrizketa-koadroaren "
"pantaila-argazkia, \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_dock %}} fitxan. Token "
"bat sortu da, eta hauta daiteke.\"](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"share_dock.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Partekatu esteka "
"leihoa - panel fitxa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "Then, copy the url, and use the \"Docks / Custom browser docks\" menu from your OBS to add a dock with this URL."
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, kopiatu URLa, eta erabili zure OBSko \"Docks / Custom browser "
"docks\" menua URL honekin panel bat gehitzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the OBS Dock menu, with a \"Custom Browser Docks\" entry.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/obs_dock_menu.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"OBS - Dock menu\")"
msgstr ""
"![OBSren Dock menuaren pantaila-argazkia, \"Custom Browser Docks\" "
"sarrerarekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"obs_dock_menu.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"OBS - Dock menua\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the OBS Custom Browser Docks dialog, with a new dock called \"My chat\".](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/obs_dock_dialog.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"OBS - Dock dialog\")"
msgstr ""
"![OBSren Custom Browser Docks elkarrizketa-koadroaren pantaila-argazkia, "
"\"My chat\" izeneko panel berri batekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"obs_dock_dialog.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"OBS - Dock "
"elkarrizketa-koadroa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "Once you have done, you will have a new dock connected to the chat with your account."
msgstr ""
"Hori egin ondoren, zure kontuarekin txatera konektatutako panel berri bat "
"izango duzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "![Screenshot of OBS with a new dock including the chat. The user is logged in with their Peertube account, and can chat directly from OBS.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/obs_dock.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"OBS - Dock\")"
msgstr ""
"![OBSren pantaila-argazkia, txata duen panel berri batekin. Erabiltzaileak "
"bere PeerTube kontuarekin hasi du saioa, eta zuzenean OBStik txateatu "
"dezake.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"obs_dock.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"OBS - Panela\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "Tokens are valid to join any chat room. You don't have to generate separate tokens for each of your rooms.  You can also customize the nickame that will be used by changing the `n` parameter in the url."
msgstr ""
"Tokenak edozein txat-gelatara sartzeko balio dute. Ez duzu token bereizirik "
"sortu behar zure gela bakoitzerako.  Erabiliko den ezizena ere pertsonaliza "
"dezakezu URLko `n` parametroa aldatuz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "Don't share these links to anyone, as it would allow them to connect as yourself."
msgstr ""
"Ez partekatu esteka hauek inorekin, zu zarela konektatzeko aukera emango "
"bailieke."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "If a token is compromised, or no more needed, you can revoke them."
msgstr ""
"Token bat arriskuan badago, edo jada behar ez bada, baliogabetu dezakezu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "These tokens can be used for other purposes, as connecting to your account with XMPP bots or clients.  This feature is not documented yet, and not officially supported. So use with care."
msgstr ""
"Token hauek beste helburu batzuetarako erabil daitezke, zure kontura XMPP "
"bot edo bezeroekin konektatzeko, adibidez.  Eginbide hau ez dago oraindik "
"dokumentatuta, ezta ofizialki onartuta ere. Beraz, erabili kontuz."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mixing multiple chats in your live stream"
msgstr "Hainbat txat nahastea zure zuzeneko igorpenean"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/obs.md
msgid "You can use the [social_stream browser extension](https://github.com/steveseguin/social_stream#readme) to mix multiple chat source (from Peertube, Twitch, Youtube, Facebook, ...) and include their contents in your live stream.  The compatibility with this plugin was added in recent versions."
msgstr ""
"[social_stream nabigatzaile-luzapena](https://github.com/steveseguin/"
"social_stream#readme) erabil dezakezu hainbat txat-iturburu (PeerTube, "
"Twitch, Youtube, Facebook, ...) nahasteko eta haien edukia zure zuzeneko "
"igorpenean sartzeko.  Osagarri honekiko bateragarritasuna azken bertsioetan "
"gehitu zen."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Room owners and administrators can send special announcements in the chat."
msgstr ""
"Gelen jabeek eta administratzaileek iragarpen bereziak bidal ditzakete "
"txatean."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Announcements"
msgstr "Iragarpenak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
msgid "These messages will be more visible than standard messages."
msgstr "Mezu hauek mezu estandarrak baino ikusgarriagoak izango dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
msgid "To send announcements, owners and administrators will have a \"{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type %}}\" selector on the top of the message field:"
msgstr ""
"Iragarpenak bidaltzeko, jabeek eta administratzaileek \"{{% livechat_label "
"announcements_message_type %}}\" hautatzaile bat izango dute mezu-eremuaren "
"goialdean:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session. On top of the message field, there is a \"{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type %}}\" selector. In the chat, we can see three types of announcements: a highlighted message, an announcement, and a warning. Each of these announcements have a special color to distinguish them. The announcement and the warning have also bold titles.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/announcements.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Announcements\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia. Mezu-eremuaren goialdean, \"{{% "
"livechat_label announcements_message_type %}}\" hautatzaile bat dago. "
"Txatean, hiru iragarpen mota ikus ditzakegu: mezu nabarmendu bat, iragarpen "
"bat eta abisu bat. Iragarpen horietako bakoitzak kolore berezi bat du "
"bereizteko. Iragarpenak eta abisuak izenburu lodiak ere badituzte.](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"announcements.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Iragarpenak\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
msgid "There are several message types:"
msgstr "Hainbat mezu mota daude:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
msgid "**{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type_standard %}}**: to send a standard message."
msgstr ""
"**{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type_standard %}}**: mezu "
"estandar bat bidaltzeko."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
msgid "**{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type_highlight %}}**: these messages will simply be highlighted in a blue box."
msgstr ""
"**{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type_highlight %}}**: mezu hauek "
"koadro urdin batean nabarmenduko dira, besterik gabe."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
msgid "**{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type_announcement %}}**: these messages will be in a green box, and a bold \"{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type_announcement %}}\" title will be added."
msgstr ""
"**{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type_announcement %}}**: mezu "
"hauek koadro berde batean egongo dira, eta \"{{% livechat_label "
"announcements_message_type_announcement %}}\" izenburu lodi bat gehituko "
"zaie."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
msgid "**{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type_warning %}}**: these messages will be in a rend box, and a bold \"{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type_announcement %}}\" title will be added."
msgstr ""
"**{{% livechat_label announcements_message_type_warning %}}**: mezu hauek "
"koadro gorri batean egongo dira, eta \"{{% livechat_label "
"announcements_message_type_announcement %}}\" izenburu lodi bat gehituko "
"zaie."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
msgid "User that are not owner or administrator of the chatroom can't send such messages."
msgstr ""
"Txat-gelaren jabe edo administratzaile ez diren erabiltzaileek ezin dituzte "
"horrelako mezuak bidali."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/announcements.md
msgid "Note: Standards XMPP clients will display announcements as standard messages."
msgstr ""
"Oharra: XMPP bezero estandarrek iragarpenak mezu estandar gisa erakutsiko "
"dituzte."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some basics about how to setup and use the chat for your live stream"
msgstr ""
"Zure zuzeneko igorpenerako txata konfiguratu eta erabiltzeko oinarri batzuk"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some basics"
msgstr "Oinarri batzuk"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enabling the chat for you live streams"
msgstr "Txata gaitzea zure zuzeneko igorpenetarako"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "Instance administrators can choose to disable or enable chat in specific cases.  Information in this section are only true in the default case."
msgstr ""
"Instantziako administratzaileek txata kasu jakin batzuetan desgaitzea edo "
"gaitzea aukera dezakete.  Atal honetako informazioa kasu lehenetsian soilik "
"da egia."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "When you create or modify a Peertube live, there is a \"plugin settings\" tab:"
msgstr ""
"PeerTube zuzeneko bat sortzen edo aldatzen duzunean, \"osagarriaren "
"ezarpenak\" fitxa bat dago:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the Peertube new live form.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/new_live.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"New live\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTuberen zuzeneko berriaren inprimakiaren pantaila-argazkia.](/peertube-"
"plugin-livechat/images/new_live.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Zuzeneko berria\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "In the \"plugin settings\" tab, there is a \"{{% livechat_label use_chat %}}\" checkbox.  Just check or uncheck it to enable or disable the chat associated to your video."
msgstr ""
"\"Osagarriaren ezarpenak\" fitxan, \"{{% livechat_label use_chat %}}\" "
"kontrol-lauki bat dago.  Markatu edo desmarkatu zure bideoari lotutako txata "
"gaitzeko edo desgaitzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the form, with a \"{{% livechat_label use_chat %}}\" checkbox.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/new_live_activate_chat.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Activate the chat\")"
msgstr ""
"![Inprimakiaren pantaila-argazkia, \"{{% livechat_label use_chat %}}\" "
"kontrol-laukiarekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"new_live_activate_chat.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Gaitu "
"txata\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "There can be other settings in this tab, depending on plugins installed on your Peertube instance."
msgstr ""
"Fitxa honetan beste ezarpen batzuk egon daitezke, zure PeerTube instantzian "
"instalatutako osagarrien arabera."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Per channel chat"
msgstr "Kanaleko txata"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "On the instance level, Peertube's administrators can choose if chat rooms are unique per video, or if there will be an unique chat room per channel.  Please contact your instance's administrators for more information on how they configure the livechat plugin."
msgstr ""
"Instantzia mailan, PeerTubeko administratzaileek aukera dezakete txat-gelak "
"bideo bakoitzeko bakarrak izatea, edo kanal bakoitzeko txat-gela bakarra "
"egotea.  Jarri harremanetan zure instantziako administratzaileekin livechat "
"osagarria nola konfiguratzen duten jakiteko."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Share the chat"
msgstr "Partekatu txata"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "On top of the chat, there is a \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" button."
msgstr ""
"Txataren goialdean, \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" botoi bat "
"dago."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "This button opens a popup, where you can obtain an url to join the chat.  This url can be shared."
msgstr ""
"Botoi honek leiho bat irekitzen du, non txatera sartzeko URL bat lor "
"dezakezun.  URL hau parteka daiteke."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "The \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_embed %}}\" tab provide some links to embed the chat in websites, or in your live stream."
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label share_chat_embed %}}\" fitxak txata webguneetan edo "
"zure zuzeneko igorpenean txertatzeko esteka batzuk eskaintzen ditu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "You can customize some options:"
msgstr "Aukera batzuk pertsonaliza ditzakezu:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "{{% livechat_label read_only %}}: you will only be able to read the chat, not write. This is useful to include the chat content in your live stream (see the [OBS documentation](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/obs))."
msgstr ""
"{{% livechat_label read_only %}}: txata irakurri baino ezin izango duzu "
"egin, ez idatzi. Erabilgarria da txataren edukia zure zuzeneko igorpenean "
"sartzeko (ikusi [OBS dokumentazioa](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/"
"user/obs))."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "{{% livechat_label use_current_theme_color %}}: if checked, your current theme colors will be added to the url, so that any user that opens the link will have the same color set."
msgstr ""
"{{% livechat_label use_current_theme_color %}}: markatuta badago, zure uneko "
"gaiaren koloreak URLari gehituko zaizkio, esteka irekitzen duen edozein "
"erabiltzailek kolore-sorta bera izan dezan."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "{{% livechat_label generate_iframe %}}: instead of an url, you will obtain an HTML snippet that you can add to your website to embed the chat."
msgstr ""
"{{% livechat_label generate_iframe %}}: URL baten ordez, zure webgunean "
"txata txertatzeko gehi dezakezun HTML zati bat lortuko duzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "For more information on the \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_dock %}}\" tab, check the [OBS documentation](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/obs)."
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label share_chat_dock %}}\" fitxari buruzko informazio "
"gehiagorako, ikusi [OBS dokumentazioa](/peertube-plugin-livechat/"
"documentation/user/obs)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "In the \"{{% livechat_label web %}}\" tab, the provided url opens the chat in the Peertube interface.  You can share this link to other users to invite them to join the chat."
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label web %}}\" fitxan, emandako URLak txata PeerTuberen "
"interfazean irekitzen du.  Esteka hau beste erabiltzaile batzuekin parteka "
"dezakezu, txatera sartzera gonbidatzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" dialog, on the \"{{% livechat_label web %}} tab. There is a url you can copy.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/share_web.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Share link popup - web tab\")"
msgstr ""
"![\"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" elkarrizketa-koadroaren "
"pantaila-argazkia, \"{{% livechat_label web %}} fitxan. Kopia dezakezun URL "
"bat dago.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"share_web.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Partekatu esteka leihoa - "
"web fitxa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "The \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" popup can also contain a \"{{% livechat_label connect_using_xmpp %}}\" tab.  This will only be available if your instance's administators have enabled an correctly configured this option.  Using this option, you can provide a link to join the chat using any [XMPP client software](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XMPP#Clients).  Using such softwares can for example facilitate moderation actions."
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" leihoak \"{{% livechat_label "
"connect_using_xmpp %}}\" fitxa bat ere izan dezake.  Zure instantziako "
"administratzaileek aukera hau gaitu eta behar bezala konfiguratu badute "
"soilik egongo da erabilgarri.  Aukera hau erabiliz, txatera edozein [XMPP "
"bezero-software](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XMPP#Clients) erabiliz "
"sartzeko esteka bat eman dezakezu.  Horrelako softwareak erabiltzeak, "
"adibidez, moderazio-ekintzak erraz ditzake."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the \"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" dialog, on the \"{{% livechat_label connect_using_xmpp %}}\" tab.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/share_xmpp_dialog.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"{{% livechat_label connect_using_xmpp %}}\")"
msgstr ""
"![\"{{% livechat_label share_chat_link %}}\" elkarrizketa-koadroaren "
"pantaila-argazkia, \"{{% livechat_label connect_using_xmpp %}}\" fitxan.](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"share_xmpp_dialog.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"{{% "
"livechat_label connect_using_xmpp %}}\")"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Moderation"
msgstr "Moderazioa"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "Please refer to the [moderation documentation](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/moderation)."
msgstr ""
"Ikusi [moderazioaren dokumentazioa](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/"
"user/streamers/moderation)."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include the chat in your video stream"
msgstr "Sartu txata zure bideo-igorpenean"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "Please refer to the [OBS documentation](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/obs)."
msgstr ""
"Ikusi [OBS dokumentazioa](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/obs)."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat persistence"
msgstr "Txataren iraunkortasuna"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "By default, the chat is persistent.  This means that the room content will be kept for a while.  User joining will see messages posted before their arrival."
msgstr ""
"Lehenespenez, txata iraunkorra da.  Horrek esan nahi du gelaren edukia "
"denbora batez gordeko dela.  Sartzen diren erabiltzaileek iritsi aurretik "
"argitaratutako mezuak ikusiko dituzte."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "You can change the persistence behaviour.  [Open the chat dropdown menu](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers), and click on \"Configure\"."
msgstr ""
"Iraunkortasunaren portaera alda dezakezu.  [Ireki txataren goitibeherako "
"menua](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers), eta egin klik "
"\"Konfiguratu\" aukeran."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the dropdown menu at the top of the chat. Several entries are available.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/top_menu.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Chat menu\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txataren goialdeko goitibeherako menuaren pantaila-argazkia. Hainbat "
"sarrera daude erabilgarri.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"top_menu.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Txataren menua\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "There are several options that can be changed."
msgstr "Alda daitezkeen hainbat aukera daude."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the chat configuration form.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/configure.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Configure chat room\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txataren konfigurazio-inprimakiaren pantaila-argazkia.](/peertube-plugin-"
"livechat/images/configure.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Konfiguratu txat-gela\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "You can for example set the default and maximum number of messages to return to 0, so that new incomers won't see any previously sent message."
msgstr ""
"Adibidez, itzuli beharreko mezu kopuru lehenetsia eta maximoa 0an ezar "
"ditzakezu, iritsi berriek aurretik bidalitako mezurik ikus ez dezaten."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "You can also uncheck \"enable archiving\": if unchecked, messages will be pruned if the server restarts."
msgstr ""
"\"Gaitu artxibatzea\" ere desmarka dezakezu: desmarkatuta badago, mezuak "
"ezabatu egingo dira zerbitzaria berrabiarazten bada."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "By unchecking \"Persistent\", the room will be cleared if there is no more participant."
msgstr ""
"\"Iraunkorra\" desmarkatuz gero, gela garbitu egingo da parte-hartzailerik "
"geratzen ez denean."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete the chat content"
msgstr "Ezabatu txataren edukia"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "If you want to delete the chat content, [open the chat dropdown menu](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers), then click on \"Destroy\".  A popup will open, asking a confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Txataren edukia ezabatu nahi baduzu, [ireki txataren goitibeherako menua](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers), eta egin klik "
"\"Suntsitu\" aukeran.  Leiho bat irekiko da, berrespena eskatuz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/basics.md
msgid "The chat will be automatically recreated each time someone tries to join it as long as the video exists, and has the \"{{% livechat_label use_chat %}}\" feature activated."
msgstr ""
"Txata automatikoki berriz sortuko da norbait bertara sartzen saiatzen den "
"bakoitzean, bideoa existitzen den eta \"{{% livechat_label use_chat %}}\" "
"eginbidea aktibatuta duen bitartean."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/commands.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bot can respond to several commands."
msgstr "Botak hainbat komandori erantzun diezaieke."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/commands.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "Komandoak"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/commands.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the channel options page, with some fields to configure the bot commands.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/bot_commands.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Commands configuration\")"
msgstr ""
"![Kanalaren aukeren orriaren pantaila-argazkia, botaren komandoak "
"konfiguratzeko eremu batzuekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"bot_commands.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Komandoen "
"konfigurazioa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/commands.md
msgid "You can setup several commands."
msgstr "Hainbat komando konfigura ditzakezu."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bot can automatically moderate messages containing forbidden words."
msgstr "Botak automatikoki modera ditzake debekatutako hitzak dituzten mezuak."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Forbidden words"
msgstr "Debekatutako hitzak"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the channel options page, with several fields to configure the forbidden words.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/bot_forbidden_words.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Forbidden words configuration\")"
msgstr ""
"![Kanalaren aukeren orriaren pantaila-argazkia, debekatutako hitzak "
"konfiguratzeko hainbat eremurekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"bot_forbidden_words.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Debekatutako "
"hitzen konfigurazioa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat message that was deleted, with the following reason: \"No url allowed\".](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/bot_deleted_message.png?classes=shadow,border&height=100px \"Deleted message\")"
msgstr ""
"![Ezabatutako txat-mezu baten pantaila-argazkia, arrazoi honekin: \"Ez da "
"URLrik onartzen\".](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"bot_deleted_message.png?classes=shadow,border&height=100px \"Ezabatutako "
"mezua\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "You can fill several \"{{% livechat_label livechat_configuration_channel_forbidden_words_label %}}\" lines.  When a user sends a message that match the configured criteria, the message will automatically be deleted."
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label livechat_configuration_channel_forbidden_words_label %}}"
"\" lerro bat baino gehiago bete ditzakezu.  Erabiltzaile batek "
"konfiguratutako irizpideekin bat datorren mezu bat bidaltzen duenean, mezua "
"automatikoki ezabatuko da."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "Here you can configure several words, group of words, or \"regular expressions\"."
msgstr ""
"Hemen hainbat hitz, hitz-talde edo \"adierazpen erregular\" konfigura "
"ditzakezu."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "Each time a user sends a message, these words will be tested.  If the message contains one of them, the message will be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaile batek mezu bat bidaltzen duen bakoitzean, hitz hauek probatuko "
"dira.  Mezuak horietako bat badu, mezua ezabatu egingo da."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "You can for example fill this field with a swear words list."
msgstr "Adibidez, eremu hau irain-hitzen zerrenda batekin bete dezakezu."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "To get some examples, please check these [forbidden words suggestions](https://framagit.org/Livingston/peertube-plugin-livechat/-/tree/main/support/forbidden_words)."
msgstr ""
"Adibide batzuk izateko, ikusi [debekatutako hitzen iradokizun](https://"
"framagit.org/Livingston/peertube-plugin-livechat/-/tree/main/support/"
"forbidden_words) hauek."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "If you have some usefull words lists, you are welcome to contribute to this suggestion page.  There are in the `support/forbidden_words` folder of the livechat source code.  See the [contribution guide](/peertube-plugin-livechat/contributing/) for more information."
msgstr ""
"Hitz-zerrenda erabilgarriak badituzu, ongi etorria zara iradokizun-orri "
"honetan laguntzera.  Livechat iturburu-kodearen `support/forbidden_words` "
"karpetan daude.  Ikusi [ekarpen-gida](/peertube-plugin-livechat/"
"contributing/) informazio gehiagorako."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "These words are case insensitive."
msgstr "Hitz hauek ez dute maiuskula/minuskula bereizten."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "You can combine a short [moderation delay](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay) (1 second for example) with the [moderation bot](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/bot) to delete messages containing swear words before any non-moderator user will see them."
msgstr ""
"[Moderazio-atzerapen](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/"
"moderation_delay) labur bat (segundo 1, adibidez) [moderazio-botarekin](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/bot) konbina dezakezu, "
"irain-hitzak dituzten mezuak moderatzaile ez den inork ikusi aurretik "
"ezabatzeko."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "This features is still experimental.  There might be some issues with non-latin alphabets.  You can [open an issue](https://github.com/JohnXLivingston/peertube-plugin-livechat/issues) to report your problems."
msgstr ""
"Eginbide hau esperimentala da oraindik.  Baliteke arazoak egotea latinoak ez "
"diren alfabetoekin.  [Arazo-txosten bat ireki](https://github.com/"
"JohnXLivingston/peertube-plugin-livechat/issues) dezakezu zure arazoen berri "
"emateko."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/forbidden_words.md
msgid "By checking this option, each line of the \"{{% livechat_label livechat_configuration_channel_forbidden_words_label %}}\" field will be considered as a [regular expression](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regular_expression)."
msgstr ""
"Aukera hau markatuz gero, \"{{% livechat_label "
"livechat_configuration_channel_forbidden_words_label %}}\" eremuko lerro "
"bakoitza [adierazpen erregular](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Regular_expression) gisa hartuko da."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/bot/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat bot setup"
msgstr "Txatbotaren konfigurazioa"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/bot/_index.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat bot"
msgstr "Txatbota"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/bot/_index.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/channel.md
msgid "This feature comes with the livechat plugin version 8.0.0, and can be disabled by your instance's admins."
msgstr ""
"Eginbide hau livechat osagarriaren 8.0.0 bertsioarekin dator, eta zure "
"instantziako administratzaileek desgai dezakete."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/bot/_index.md
msgid "You can enable a chat bot on your chatrooms.  The bot configuration is made channel per channel, and will apply to all related videos' chatrooms."
msgstr ""
"Txatbot bat gai dezakezu zure txat-geletan.  Botaren konfigurazioa kanalez "
"kanal egiten da, eta lotutako bideoen txat-gela guztiei aplikatuko zaie."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/bot/_index.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/channel.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the channel options. There is a form with multiple fields.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/channel_configuration.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Channel configuration\")"
msgstr ""
"![Kanalaren aukeren pantaila-argazkia. Hainbat eremu dituen inprimaki bat "
"dago.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"channel_configuration.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Kanalaren "
"konfigurazioa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/bot/_index.md
msgid "To access this page, check the [channel configuration documentation](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/channel)."
msgstr ""
"Orri honetara sartzeko, ikusi [kanalaren konfigurazioaren dokumentazioa](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/channel)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/bot/_index.md
msgid "Once there, you can enable the bot, and setup several options:"
msgstr "Bertan, bota gai dezakezu eta hainbat aukera konfiguratu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/bot/_index.md
msgid "The bot will reload instantly when you save the page."
msgstr "Bota berehala birkargatuko da orria gordetzen duzunean."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/no_duplicate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bot can automatically moderate duplicate messages."
msgstr "Botak automatikoki modera ditzake mezu bikoiztuak."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/no_duplicate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "No duplicate message"
msgstr "Mezu bikoiztuen debekua"

#. type: Title ##
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/no_duplicate.md
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/special_chars.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurazioa"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/no_duplicate.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the channel options page, with several fields to configure the \"No duplicate message\" option.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/bot_no_duplicate.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"No duplicate message configuration\")"
msgstr ""
"![Kanalaren aukeren orriaren pantaila-argazkia, \"Mezu bikoiztuen debekua\" "
"aukera konfiguratzeko hainbat eremurekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"bot_no_duplicate.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Mezu bikoiztuen "
"debekuaren konfigurazioa\")"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/quotes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bot can send periodically some messages."
msgstr "Botak aldian-aldian mezu batzuk bidal ditzake."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/quotes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Timers"
msgstr "Tenporizadoreak"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/quotes.md
msgid "If there is no user in the chatroom, the bot won't send any message."
msgstr "Txat-gelan erabiltzailerik ez badago, botak ez du mezurik bidaliko."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/bot/quotes.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the channel options page, with some fields to configure a new timer.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/bot_quotes.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Timers configuration\")"
msgstr ""
"![Kanalaren aukeren orriaren pantaila-argazkia, tenporizadore berri bat "
"konfiguratzeko eremu batzuekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"bot_quotes.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Tenporizadoreen "
"konfigurazioa\")"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
