#. type: Title ###
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import / Export"
msgstr "Inportatu / Esportatu"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis.md
msgid "On the channel configuration page, there are an \"{{% livechat_label action_import %}}\" and an \"{{% livechat_label action_export %}}\" button.  The \"{{% livechat_label action_export %}}\" button generates a file than you can then import on another channel."
msgstr ""
"Kanalaren konfigurazio-orrian, \"{{% livechat_label action_import %}}\" eta "
"\"{{% livechat_label action_export %}}\" botoiak daude.  \"{{% "
"livechat_label action_export %}}\" botoiak fitxategi bat sortzen du, gero "
"beste kanal batean inporta dezakezuna."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis.md
msgid "You can also generate a file to import from any other source (for example you can import your Twitch custom emojis).  The file must be a valid JSON file, using the following format:"
msgstr ""
"Beste edozein iturburutatik inportatzeko fitxategi bat ere sor dezakezu "
"(adibidez, zure Twitch emoji pertsonalizatuak inporta ditzakezu).  "
"Fitxategiak baliozko JSON fitxategia izan behar du, formatu hau erabiliz:"

#. type: Fenced code block (json)
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[\n"
"  {\n"
"    \"sn\": \":short_name:\",\n"
"    \"url\": \"https://example.com/image.png\"\n"
"  }\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"[\n"
"  {\n"
"    \"sn\": \":short_name:\",\n"
"    \"url\": \"https://example.com/image.png\"\n"
"  }\n"
"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis.md
msgid "The `sn` attribute is the short name code.  The `url` attribute can be any image url than your browser can access, or a [Data URL](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Basics_of_HTTP/Data_URLs) representing the file you want to import."
msgstr ""
"`sn` atributua izen laburraren kodea da.  `url` atributua zure "
"nabigatzaileak atzi dezakeen edozein irudi-URL izan daiteke, edo inportatu "
"nahi duzun fitxategia adierazten duen [Data URL](https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Basics_of_HTTP/Data_URLs) bat."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis_only.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plugin peertube-plugin-livechat emojis only mode"
msgstr "peertube-plugin-livechat osagarriaren emoji soilik modua"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis_only.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Emojis only mode"
msgstr "Emoji soilik modua"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis_only.md
msgid "This mode can be usefull for example:"
msgstr "Modu hau erabilgarria izan daiteke, adibidez:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis_only.md
msgid "To avoid spam or offensive message when you are not here to moderate."
msgstr ""
"Spama edo mezu iraingarriak saihesteko, moderatzeko bertan ez zaudenean."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis_only.md
msgid "When there are too many speaking participants, and you can't no more moderate correctly."
msgstr ""
"Hizketan ari diren parte-hartzaile gehiegi daudenean, eta ezin duzunean jada "
"behar bezala moderatu."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis_only.md
msgid "To enable or disable this feature, use the [chat dropdown menu](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers), open the \"configure\" menu.  In the form, you will find a \"{{% livechat_label emoji_only_mode_title %}}\" checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Eginbide hau gaitzeko edo desgaitzeko, erabili [txataren goitibeherako menua]"
"(/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers), eta ireki "
"\"konfiguratu\" menua.  Inprimakian, \"{{% livechat_label "
"emoji_only_mode_title %}}\" kontrol-lauki bat aurkituko duzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/emojis_only.md
msgid "If you want to enable it for all your chatrooms at once, open the [channel emojis configuration page](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/emojis/), and use the \"{{% livechat_label emoji_only_enable_all_rooms %}}\" button."
msgstr ""
"Zure txat-gela guztietan batera gaitu nahi baduzu, ireki [kanalaren emojien "
"konfigurazio-orria](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/"
"emojis/), eta erabili \"{{% livechat_label emoji_only_enable_all_rooms %}}\" "
"botoia."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to setup the chat for your live stream"
msgstr "Nola konfiguratu txata zure zuzeneko igorpenerako"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For streamers"
msgstr "Igorleentzat"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plugin peertube-plugin-livechat moderation delay"
msgstr "peertube-plugin-livechat osagarriaren moderazio-atzerapena"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Moderation delay"
msgstr "Moderazio-atzerapena"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Sarrera"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "As a streamer, you can choose to delay messages in the chat, to let some time to moderators to delete messages before they can even be read by other participants."
msgstr ""
"Igorle gisa, txateko mezuak atzeratzea aukera dezakezu, moderatzaileei "
"denbora emateko mezuak ezabatzeko beste parte-hartzaileek irakurri aurretik."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "When this feature is enabled, moderators will see all messages without any delay.  Chat participants won't see that their own messages are delayed."
msgstr ""
"Eginbide hau gaituta dagoenean, moderatzaileek mezu guztiak atzerapenik gabe "
"ikusiko dituzte.  Txateko parte-hartzaileek ez dute ikusiko beren mezuak "
"atzeratuta daudenik."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "Please note that messages sent by moderators will also be delayed, to avoid them to respond to messages that are not even visible by other participants."
msgstr ""
"Kontuan hartu moderatzaileek bidalitako mezuak ere atzeratuko direla, beste "
"parte-hartzaileek oraindik ikusten ez dituzten mezuei erantzun ez diezaieten."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Moderation delay option"
msgstr "Moderazio-atzerapenaren aukera"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "On the [channel configuration page](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/channel), you can set the \"{{% livechat_label moderation_delay %}}\" option:"
msgstr ""
"[Kanalaren konfigurazio-orrian](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/"
"streamers/channel), \"{{% livechat_label moderation_delay %}}\" aukera ezar "
"dezakezu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the channel option form, with a field to configure the moderation delay.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/moderation_delay_channel_option.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Channel configuration / Moderation delay\")"
msgstr ""
"![Kanalaren aukeren inprimakiaren pantaila-argazkia, moderazio-atzerapena "
"konfiguratzeko eremu batekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"moderation_delay_channel_option.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px "
"\"Kanalaren konfigurazioa / Moderazio-atzerapena\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "This value will apply as a default value for all your channel's chatrooms."
msgstr ""
"Balio hau balio lehenetsi gisa aplikatuko zaie zure kanaleko txat-gela "
"guztiei."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "Setting the value to `0` will disable the feature."
msgstr "Balioa `0`an ezartzeak eginbidea desgaituko du."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "Setting the value to a positive integer will set the delay, in seconds, to apply to messages.  Please avoid setting the value too high.  Ideally it should not exceed a few seconds (4 or 5 seconds for example)."
msgstr ""
"Balioa zenbaki oso positibo batean ezartzeak mezuei aplikatu beharreko "
"atzerapena ezarriko du, segundotan.  Saihestu balio handiegia ezartzea.  "
"Egokiena da segundo gutxi batzuk ez gainditzea (4 edo 5 segundo, adibidez)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "To modify the value for an already existing room, just open the room \"configuration\" menu (on top of the chat window), and change the moderation delay value in the configuration form."
msgstr ""
"Lehendik dagoen gela baten balioa aldatzeko, ireki gelaren \"konfigurazioa\" "
"menua (txat-leihoaren goialdean), eta aldatu moderazio-atzerapenaren balioa "
"konfigurazio-inprimakian."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "Currently, this feature has one known bug: users that join the chat will get all messages, even messages that are still pending for other participants.  However, messages sent after they joined will be delayed correctly."
msgstr ""
"Une honetan, eginbide honek akats ezagun bat du: txatera sartzen diren "
"erabiltzaileek mezu guztiak jasoko dituzte, baita beste parte-"
"hartzaileentzat oraindik zain dauden mezuak ere.  Hala ere, sartu ondoren "
"bidalitako mezuak behar bezala atzeratuko dira."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the chat"
msgstr "Txatean"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "As a moderator, you will see the remaining time (in seconds) before the message is broadcasted, just besides the message datetime."
msgstr ""
"Moderatzaile gisa, mezua zabaldu aurretik geratzen den denbora (segundotan) "
"ikusiko duzu, mezuaren data eta orduaren ondoan."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_delay.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat message. A timer is displayed next to the message datetime. The timer is in seconds.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/moderation_delay_timer.png?classes=shadow,border \"Moderation delay timer\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-mezu baten pantaila-argazkia. Tenporizadore bat erakusten da mezuaren "
"data eta orduaren ondoan. Tenporizadorea segundotan dago.](/peertube-plugin-"
"livechat/images/moderation_delay_timer.png?classes=shadow,border \"Moderazio-"
"atzerapenaren tenporizadorea\")"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plugin peertube-plugin-livechat advanced moderation features"
msgstr "peertube-plugin-livechat osagarriaren moderazio-eginbide aurreratuak"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "This section is still incomplete."
msgstr "Atal hau osatu gabe dago oraindik."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This page describes the behaviour of livechat versions >= 10.0.0.\n"
"There were some changes in the way we manage access rights for Peertube administrators and moderators.\n"
msgstr ""
"Orri honek livechat >= 10.0.0 bertsioen portaera deskribatzen du.\n"
"Aldaketa batzuk egon ziren PeerTubeko administratzaile eta moderatzaileen "
"sarbide-eskubideak kudeatzeko moduan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The chat bot"
msgstr "Txatbota"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "You can use a chat bot, that will help you for moderation.  Check [the chat bot documentation](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/bot) for more information."
msgstr ""
"Txatbot bat erabil dezakezu, moderazioan lagunduko dizuna.  Ikusi "
"[txatbotaren dokumentazioa](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/"
"streamers/bot) informazio gehiagorako."

#. type: Title ##
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Accessing moderation tools"
msgstr "Moderazio-tresnetara sartzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "You can access room settings and moderation tools using the [chat dropdown menu](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers) at the top of the chat."
msgstr ""
"Gelaren ezarpenetara eta moderazio-tresnetara sar zaitezke txataren "
"goialdeko [goitibeherako menua](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/"
"viewers) erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "The video owner will be owner of the chat room.  This means they can configure the room, delete it, promote other users as admins, ..."
msgstr ""
"Bideoaren jabea txat-gelaren jabea izango da.  Horrek esan nahi du gela "
"konfigura dezakeela, ezabatu, beste erabiltzaile batzuk administratzaile "
"bihurtu, ..."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "Starting with livechat v10.0.0, Peertube instance's admins and moderators have no special rights on rooms by default.  However, they have a special button available on top of the chat: \"{{% livechat_label promote %}}\".  Clicking this button will give them owner access on the room."
msgstr ""
"Livechat v10.0.0 bertsiotik aurrera, PeerTube instantziako "
"administratzaileek eta moderatzaileek ez dute eskubide berezirik geletan "
"lehenespenez.  Hala ere, botoi berezi bat dute txataren goialdean: \"{{% "
"livechat_label promote %}}\".  Botoi honetan klik eginez, gelaren jabe-"
"sarbidea emango zaie."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "You can use [ConverseJS moderation commands](https://conversejs.org/docs/html/features.html#moderating-chatrooms) to moderate the room.  When you open the chat room in full screen, there will also be a menu with dedicated commands on the top right."
msgstr ""
"[ConverseJSren moderazio-komandoak](https://conversejs.org/docs/html/"
"features.html#moderating-chatrooms) erabil ditzakezu gela moderatzeko.  Txat-"
"gela pantaila osoan irekitzen duzunean, goian eskuinean komando espezifikoak "
"dituen menu bat ere egongo da."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "You can prevent anonymous users to send messages. In such case, only registered users will be able to talk in the chat."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaile anonimoei mezuak bidaltzea eragotz diezaiekezu. Kasu horretan, "
"izena emandako erabiltzaileek soilik hitz egin ahal izango dute txatean."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "To enable or disable this feature, use the [chat dropdown menu](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers), open the \"configure\" menu.  In the form, you will find a \"{{% livechat_label livechat_configuration_channel_mute_anonymous_label %}}\" checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Eginbide hau gaitzeko edo desgaitzeko, erabili [txataren goitibeherako menua]"
"(/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers), eta ireki "
"\"konfiguratu\" menua.  Inprimakian, \"{{% livechat_label "
"livechat_configuration_channel_mute_anonymous_label %}}\" kontrol-lauki bat "
"aurkituko duzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the room configuration form. There is a \"{{% livechat_label livechat_configuration_channel_mute_anonymous_label %}}\" checkbox.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/configure_mute_anonymous.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Room configuration / Mute anonymous users\")"
msgstr ""
"![Gelaren konfigurazio-inprimakiaren pantaila-argazkia. \"{{% livechat_label "
"livechat_configuration_channel_mute_anonymous_label %}}\" kontrol-lauki bat "
"dago.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"configure_mute_anonymous.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Gelaren "
"konfigurazioa / Mututu erabiltzaile anonimoak\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "Anonymous users won't have the message field, and will see following prompt: \"{{% livechat_label muted_anonymous_message %}}\""
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaile anonimoek ez dute mezu-eremurik izango, eta mezu hau ikusiko "
"dute: \"{{% livechat_label muted_anonymous_message %}}\""

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session. The current user has no message field. There is a message: \"{{% livechat_label muted_anonymous_message %}}\"](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/anonymous_muted.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Room configuration / Muted anonymous users\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia. Uneko erabiltzaileak ez du mezu-"
"eremurik. Mezu bat dago: \"{{% livechat_label muted_anonymous_message %}}\"]"
"(/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"anonymous_muted.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Gelaren "
"konfigurazioa / Erabiltzaile anonimo mutuak\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "When this feature is enabled, anonymous users will be assigned the \"visitor\" role.  You can change their role to \"participant\" if you want to allow some of them to talk."
msgstr ""
"Eginbide hau gaituta dagoenean, erabiltzaile anonimoei \"bisitari\" rola "
"esleituko zaie.  Haien rola \"parte-hartzaile\" bihur dezakezu, horietako "
"batzuei hitz egiten utzi nahi badiezu."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "If you change the room configuration, all anonymous users will be muted or unmuted."
msgstr ""
"Gelaren konfigurazioa aldatzen baduzu, erabiltzaile anonimo guztiak mututu "
"edo desmututu egingo dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "You can choose to enable or disable this feature for new chatrooms on the [channel configuration page](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/channel)."
msgstr ""
"Txat-gela berrietarako eginbide hau gaitzea edo desgaitzea aukera dezakezu "
"[kanalaren konfigurazio-orrian](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/"
"streamers/channel)."

#. type: Title ##
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Roles and affiliations"
msgstr "Rolak eta afiliazioak"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "There are several roles that can be assignated to users in chat rooms: owner, moderators, member, ..."
msgstr ""
"Txat-geletan erabiltzaileei hainbat rol esleitu dakizkieke: jabea, "
"moderatzaileak, kidea, ..."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "You can promote users as moderators, if you need some help."
msgstr "Erabiltzaileak moderatzaile bihur ditzakezu, laguntza behar baduzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "It is possible to anonymize moderation actions, to avoid disclosing who is banning/kicking/… occupants."
msgstr ""
"Moderazio-ekintzak anonimiza daitezke, nork debekatzen/kanporatzen/… dituen "
"parte-hartzaileak ez ezagutarazteko."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "To enable or disable this feature, use the [chat dropdown menu](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers), open the \"configure\" menu.  In the form, you will find a \"{{% livechat_label livechat_configuration_channel_anonymize_moderation_label %}}\" checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Eginbide hau gaitzeko edo desgaitzeko, erabili [txataren goitibeherako menua]"
"(/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/viewers), eta ireki "
"\"konfiguratu\" menua.  Inprimakian, \"{{% livechat_label "
"livechat_configuration_channel_anonymize_moderation_label %}}\" kontrol-"
"lauki bat aurkituko duzu."

#. type: Title ##
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Participant message history search"
msgstr "Parte-hartzaile baten mezu-historiaren bilaketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "As a room admin or owner, you can search all messages sent by a given participant."
msgstr ""
"Gelaren administratzaile edo jabe gisa, parte-hartzaile jakin batek "
"bidalitako mezu guztiak bila ditzakezu."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "To do so, you have several ways:"
msgstr "Horretarako, hainbat modu dituzu:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "using the \"{{% livechat_label search_occupant_message %}}\" action in the dropdown menu besides participants in the sidebar"
msgstr ""
"alboko barrako parte-hartzaileen ondoko goitibeherako menuko \"{{% "
"livechat_label search_occupant_message %}}\" ekintza erabiliz"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "using the \"{{% livechat_label search_occupant_message %}}\" action in the dropdown menu besides chat messages"
msgstr ""
"txat-mezuen ondoko goitibeherako menuko \"{{% livechat_label "
"search_occupant_message %}}\" ekintza erabiliz"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session. The moderator has open the message menu, and there is a \"{{% livechat_label search_occupant_message %}}\" button.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/message_search.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Message history search\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia. Moderatzaileak mezuaren menua ireki du, "
"eta \"{{% livechat_label search_occupant_message %}}\" botoi bat dago.](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"message_search.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Mezu-historiaren "
"bilaketa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "To have more space and better readability, open the chat in full-page mode."
msgstr ""
"Leku gehiago eta irakurgarritasun hobea izateko, ireki txata orri osoko "
"moduan."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "In the search results, there are several informations that are shown at the right of the participant nickname:"
msgstr ""
"Bilaketaren emaitzetan, hainbat informazio erakusten dira parte-"
"hartzailearen ezizenaren eskuinean:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "if the current nickname is different than the nickname when the participant has sent the message, the original nickname will be shown"
msgstr ""
"uneko ezizena parte-hartzaileak mezua bidali zuenekoaren desberdina bada, "
"jatorrizko ezizena erakutsiko da"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "you will see the [JID (Jabber ID)](https://xmpp.org/extensions/xep-0029.html) of the participant"
msgstr ""
"parte-hartzailearen [JIDa (Jabber IDa)](https://xmpp.org/extensions/xep-"
"0029.html) ikusiko duzu"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "you will also see the [occupant-id](https://xmpp.org/extensions/xep-0421.html) of the participant"
msgstr ""
"parte-hartzailearen [occupant-id](https://xmpp.org/extensions/xep-0421.html) "
"ere ikusiko duzu"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "The search result will also include all messages related to participants who had the same nickname.  You can differenciate them by comparing [JID](https://xmpp.org/extensions/xep-0029.html) and [occupant-id](https://xmpp.org/extensions/xep-0421.html)."
msgstr ""
"Bilaketaren emaitzak ezizen bera izan duten parte-hartzaileei lotutako mezu "
"guztiak ere izango ditu.  [JIDa](https://xmpp.org/extensions/xep-0029.html) "
"eta [occupant-id](https://xmpp.org/extensions/xep-0421.html) alderatuz "
"bereiz ditzakezu."

#. type: Title ##
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete room content"
msgstr "Ezabatu gelaren edukia"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "You can delete old rooms: join the room, and use the menu on the top to destroy the room."
msgstr ""
"Gela zaharrak ezaba ditzakezu: sartu gelara, eta erabili goiko menua gela "
"suntsitzeko."

#. type: Title ##
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance moderation"
msgstr "Instantziaren moderazioa"

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "As Peertube instance moderator or administrator, you will probably need to check that your users are not behaving badly."
msgstr ""
"PeerTube instantziako moderatzaile edo administratzaile gisa, ziurrenik "
"egiaztatu beharko duzu zure erabiltzaileak gaizki portatzen ez direla."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "You can list all existing chatrooms: in the plugin settings screen, there is a button «List rooms»."
msgstr ""
"Dauden txat-gela guztiak zerrenda ditzakezu: osagarriaren ezarpenen "
"pantailan, «Zerrendatu gelak» botoi bat dago."

#. type: Plain text
#: build/documentation/pot_in/documentation/user/streamers/moderation.md
msgid "From there, you can also promote yourself as room moderator by using the \"{{% livechat_label promote %}}\" button on the right."
msgstr ""
"Hortik, zeure burua gelaren moderatzaile ere bihur dezakezu, eskuineko \"{{% "
"livechat_label promote %}}\" botoia erabiliz."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plugin peertube-plugin-livechat moderation notes"
msgstr "peertube-plugin-livechat osagarriaren moderazio-oharrak"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Moderation notes"
msgstr "Moderazio-oharrak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "The livechat plugin includes a Moderator Notes Application: you can write some notes, that could be associated to chat participants.  Every room's admins have access to these notes, so they can edit them collaboratively."
msgstr ""
"Livechat osagarriak Moderatzaileen Oharren Aplikazio bat dakar: ohar batzuk "
"idatz ditzakezu, txateko parte-hartzaileei lotu daitezkeenak.  Gela "
"bakoitzeko administratzaile guztiek ohar hauetarako sarbidea dute, "
"elkarlanean editatu ahal izateko."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "You can for example use this Application to:"
msgstr "Adibidez, Aplikazio hau erabil dezakezu:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "share some notes between moderators"
msgstr "moderatzaileen artean ohar batzuk partekatzeko"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "take notes about participants that were kicked or caused troubles"
msgstr ""
"kanporatu diren edo arazoak sortu dituzten parte-hartzaileei buruzko oharrak "
"hartzeko"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Moderator Notes Application"
msgstr "Moderatzaileen Oharren Aplikazioa erabiltzea"

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Opening the Moderator Notes Application"
msgstr "Moderatzaileen Oharren Aplikazioa irekitzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "To open the Moderator Notes Application, there is a \"{{% livechat_label \"moderator_notes\" %}}\" button in the top chat menu:"
msgstr ""
"Moderatzaileen Oharren Aplikazioa irekitzeko, \"{{% livechat_label "
"\"moderator_notes\" %}}\" botoi bat dago txataren goiko menuan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a Peertube video, with the chat on the right. The chat top menu is open, with a \"{{% livechat_label \"moderator_notes\" %}}\" button.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/moderation_notes_open_app_video.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Opening the Moderator Notes Application\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTube bideo baten pantaila-argazkia, txata eskuinean duela. Txataren "
"goiko menua irekita dago, \"{{% livechat_label \"moderator_notes\" %}}\" "
"botoiarekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"moderation_notes_open_app_video.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Moderatzaileen Oharren Aplikazioa irekitzea\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a Peertube chat, fullscreen. The chat top menu open, with a \"{{% livechat_label \"moderator_notes\" %}}\" button.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/moderation_notes_open_app_fullpage.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Opening the Moderator Notes Application\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTube txat baten pantaila-argazkia, pantaila osoan. Txataren goiko "
"menua irekita, \"{{% livechat_label \"moderator_notes\" %}}\" botoiarekin.](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"moderation_notes_open_app_fullpage.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Moderatzaileen Oharren Aplikazioa irekitzea\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "Clicking this button will toggle the Application display:"
msgstr "Botoi honetan klik eginez, Aplikazioa erakutsi edo ezkutatuko da:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a Peertube video, with the chat on the right. The moderation notes application is open. There are several notes, some of them are associated to users.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/moderator_notes_app_video_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Moderator Notes Application\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTube bideo baten pantaila-argazkia, txata eskuinean duela. Moderazio-"
"oharren aplikazioa irekita dago. Hainbat ohar daude, eta horietako batzuk "
"erabiltzaileei lotuta daude.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"moderator_notes_app_video_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Moderatzaileen Oharren Aplikazioa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a Peertube chat, fullscreen. The moderation notes application is open. There are several notes, some of them are associated to users.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/moderator_notes_app_fullpage_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Moderator Notes Application\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTube txat baten pantaila-argazkia, pantaila osoan. Moderazio-oharren "
"aplikazioa irekita dago. Hainbat ohar daude, eta horietako batzuk "
"erabiltzaileei lotuta daude.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"moderator_notes_app_fullpage_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Moderatzaileen Oharren Aplikazioa\")"

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access rights"
msgstr "Sarbide-eskubideak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "Every room's admins have access to this Application (read and write access)."
msgstr ""
"Gela bakoitzeko administratzaile guztiek Aplikazio honetarako sarbidea dute "
"(irakurtzeko eta idazteko)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "When you promote someone as room admin or owner, they gets instant access to this Application.  When you remove admin or owner rights to someone, they instantly lose access to this Application."
msgstr ""
"Norbait gelaren administratzaile edo jabe bihurtzen duzunean, berehala "
"izango du Aplikazio honetarako sarbidea.  Norbaiti administratzaile edo jabe "
"eskubideak kentzen dizkiozunean, berehala galduko du Aplikazio honetarako "
"sarbidea."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "Esparrua"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "Notes are only available in the room in which you have created them."
msgstr "Oharrak sortu dituzun gelan soilik daude erabilgarri."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "Chatrooms can be releated to video or channel.  If you want to keep notes from one video to another, please consider using rooms associated to channels."
msgstr ""
"Txat-gelak bideo bati edo kanal bati lotuta egon daitezke.  Bideo batetik "
"bestera oharrak gorde nahi badituzu, kontuan hartu kanalei lotutako gelak "
"erabiltzea."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "Currently the video vs channel rooms is an instance-wide settings.  Only Peertube admins can change it, and it applies to all chatrooms.  In the future, this choice will be added in your channel's options."
msgstr ""
"Une honetan, bideoko edo kanaleko gelen aukera instantzia osoko ezarpena "
"da.  PeerTubeko administratzaileek soilik alda dezakete, eta txat-gela "
"guztiei aplikatzen zaie.  Etorkizunean, aukera hau zure kanalaren aukeretan "
"gehituko da."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Oharrak"

#. type: Title ####
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create/Edit Notes"
msgstr "Sortu/editatu oharrak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "You can use the plus button on the top to create a new note.  You can also edit existing notes using the edit button, or delate any note."
msgstr ""
"Goiko gehi botoia erabil dezakezu ohar berri bat sortzeko.  Lehendik dauden "
"oharrak ere edita ditzakezu editatzeko botoia erabiliz, edo edozein ohar "
"ezabatu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "All modification are instantly visible in all your browser tabs, and for all room's admins."
msgstr ""
"Aldaketa guztiak berehala ikusten dira zure nabigatzaileko fitxa guztietan, "
"eta gelako administratzaile guztientzat."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "You can create a note associated to a participant in several ways:"
msgstr "Parte-hartzaile bati lotutako ohar bat hainbat modutan sor dezakezu:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "using the \"{{% livechat_label moderator_note_create_for_participant %}}\" action in the dropdown menu besides participants in the sidebar"
msgstr ""
"alboko barrako parte-hartzaileen ondoko goitibeherako menuko \"{{% "
"livechat_label moderator_note_create_for_participant %}}\" ekintza erabiliz"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "using the \"{{% livechat_label moderator_note_create_for_participant %}}\" action in the dropdown menu besides chat messages"
msgstr ""
"txat-mezuen ondoko goitibeherako menuko \"{{% livechat_label "
"moderator_note_create_for_participant %}}\" ekintza erabiliz"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "When a note is associated to a participant, you will see their nickname and avatar on the top of the note."
msgstr ""
"Ohar bat parte-hartzaile bati lotuta dagoenean, haren ezizena eta abatarra "
"ikusiko dituzu oharraren goialdean."

#. type: Title ####
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notes filtering"
msgstr "Oharren iragazketa"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "You can filter notes to find all notes related to a given participant in several ways:"
msgstr ""
"Oharrak iragaz ditzakezu parte-hartzaile jakin bati lotutako ohar guztiak "
"aurkitzeko, hainbat modutan:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "click on the \"{{% livechat_label moderator_note_search_for_participant %}}\" button that is available on notes to find all notes related to the same participant"
msgstr ""
"egin klik oharretan dagoen \"{{% livechat_label "
"moderator_note_search_for_participant %}}\" botoian, parte-hartzaile berari "
"lotutako ohar guztiak aurkitzeko"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "click on the \"{{% livechat_label moderator_note_search_for_participant %}}\" button in the dropdown menu besides participants in the sidebar"
msgstr ""
"egin klik alboko barrako parte-hartzaileen ondoko goitibeherako menuko \"{{% "
"livechat_label moderator_note_search_for_participant %}}\" botoian"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "click on the \"{{% livechat_label moderator_note_search_for_participant %}}\" button in the dropdown menu besides chat messages"
msgstr ""
"egin klik txat-mezuen ondoko goitibeherako menuko \"{{% livechat_label "
"moderator_note_search_for_participant %}}\" botoian"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "You can remove the filter by clicking on the close button."
msgstr "Iragazkia ken dezakezu ixteko botoian klik eginez."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the note application, with a filter enabled for user \"Mike\". The only notes that are shown are the notes for the Mike user.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/moderation_notes_filters.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Moderator Notes Application - filtering\")"
msgstr ""
"![Oharren aplikazioaren pantaila-argazkia, \"Mike\" erabiltzailearentzako "
"iragazki batekin. Erakusten diren ohar bakarrak Mike erabiltzailearenak "
"dira.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"moderation_notes_filters.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Moderatzaileen Oharren Aplikazioa - iragazketa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "When you filters notes on a participant, there are several informations that are shown at the right of the participant nickname:"
msgstr ""
"Parte-hartzaile baten arabera oharrak iragaztean, hainbat informazio "
"erakusten dira parte-hartzailearen ezizenaren eskuinean:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "if the current nickname is different than the nickname when you created the note, the original nickname will be shown"
msgstr ""
"uneko ezizena oharra sortu zenuenekoaren desberdina bada, jatorrizko ezizena "
"erakutsiko da"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "The search result will also include all notes related to participants who had the same nickname.  So you can also take note for anonymous users (who don't have any consistent JID or occupant-id).  You can differenciate them by comparing JID and occupant-id."
msgstr ""
"Bilaketaren emaitzak ezizen bera izan duten parte-hartzaileei lotutako ohar "
"guztiak ere izango ditu.  Beraz, erabiltzaile anonimoei buruzko oharrak ere "
"har ditzakezu (JID edo occupant-id koherenterik ez dutenak).  JIDa eta "
"occupant-id alderatuz bereiz ditzakezu."

#. type: Title ####
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sorting notes"
msgstr "Oharrak ordenatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/moderation_notes.md
msgid "You can sort notes simply using drag & drop."
msgstr "Oharrak ordena ditzakezu arrastatu eta jareginez, besterik gabe."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can create polls to ask viewers their opinion"
msgstr "Inkestak sor ditzakezu ikusleei beren iritzia galdetzeko"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Polls"
msgstr "Inkestak"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a poll"
msgstr "Sortu inkesta bat"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "You can create a new poll by using the \"{{% livechat_label new_poll %}}\" action in the chat top menu:"
msgstr ""
"Inkesta berri bat sor dezakezu txataren goiko menuko \"{{% livechat_label "
"new_poll %}}\" ekintza erabiliz:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a \"{{% livechat_label new_poll %}}\" form. The form contains several fields: question, duration, choices, …](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/polls_form.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Poll form\")"
msgstr ""
"![\"{{% livechat_label new_poll %}}\" inprimaki baten pantaila-argazkia. "
"Inprimakiak hainbat eremu ditu: galdera, iraupena, aukerak, …](/peertube-"
"plugin-livechat/images/polls_form.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Inkesta-inprimakia\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "This poll feature should not be considered as a reliable voting system.  It is easy to cheat.  There is no mechanism to prevent anonymous users to vote multiple times by just reloading the chat.  Votes are never fully anonymous, someone having access to the server could see who voted for what choice."
msgstr ""
"Inkesta-eginbide hau ez litzateke bozketa-sistema fidagarritzat hartu "
"behar.  Erraza da tranpa egitea.  Ez dago mekanismorik erabiltzaile "
"anonimoek hainbat aldiz bozka dezaten eragozteko, txata birkargatze "
"hutsarekin.  Botoak ez dira inoiz guztiz anonimoak; zerbitzarirako sarbidea "
"duen norbaitek ikus dezake nork zer aukeraren alde bozkatu duen."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Poll form"
msgstr "Inkesta-inprimakia"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "Fill the form fields:"
msgstr "Bete inprimakiaren eremuak:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "\"{{% livechat_label poll_question %}}\": the question to ask to you viewers"
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label poll_question %}}\": zure ikusleei egin beharreko "
"galdera"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "\"{{% livechat_label poll_duration %}}\": the duration for which viewers can vote"
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label poll_duration %}}\": ikusleek bozkatu dezaketen denbora"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "\"{{% livechat_label poll_anonymous_results %}}\": if checked, votes won't be publicly visible in the chat"
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label poll_anonymous_results %}}\": markatuta badago, botoak "
"ez dira publikoki ikusiko txatean"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "\"Choice N\": choices that will be presented to viewers"
msgstr "\"N. aukera\": ikusleei aurkeztuko zaizkien aukerak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "You must at least fill the two first choices fields."
msgstr "Gutxienez lehen bi aukeren eremuak bete behar dituzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "Once you submit the form, the poll will instantly start."
msgstr "Inprimakia bidali bezain laster, inkesta hasiko da."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "If there was a previous unfinished poll, it will end and its result will be shown."
msgstr ""
"Aurretik amaitu gabeko inkesta bat bazegoen, amaitu egingo da eta haren "
"emaitza erakutsiko da."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "Every room's admins can create a new poll."
msgstr ""
"Gela bakoitzeko administratzaile guztiek sor dezakete inkesta berri bat."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "When you promote someone as room admin or owner, they gets instant access to the \"{{% livechat_label new_poll %}}\" action."
msgstr ""
"Norbait gelaren administratzaile edo jabe bihurtzen duzunean, berehala "
"izango du \"{{% livechat_label new_poll %}}\" ekintzarako sarbidea."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "When you remove admin or owner rights to someone, they can't create new poll. But any existing poll will continue until it ends."
msgstr ""
"Norbaiti administratzaile edo jabe eskubideak kentzen dizkiozunean, ezin "
"izango du inkesta berririk sortu. Baina lehendik dagoen edozein inkestak "
"amaitu arte jarraituko du."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "Every user that is not muted can vote.  This means that you can prevent anonymous users to vote by using the [\"{{% livechat_label livechat_configuration_channel_mute_anonymous_label %}}\" feature](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/moderation)."
msgstr ""
"Mutututa ez dagoen erabiltzaile orok bozka dezake.  Horrek esan nahi du "
"erabiltzaile anonimoei bozkatzea eragotz diezaiekezula [\"{{% livechat_label "
"livechat_configuration_channel_mute_anonymous_label %}}\" eginbidea](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/moderation) erabiliz."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Poll workflow"
msgstr "Inkestaren fluxua"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "When the polls starts, a first message will be sent in the chat, from the account of the user creating the poll."
msgstr ""
"Inkesta hastean, lehen mezu bat bidaliko da txatean, inkesta sortzen duen "
"erabiltzailearen kontutik."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "A banner will also appear to show the poll, and will be updated regularly with the current votes."
msgstr ""
"Banner bat ere agertuko da inkesta erakusteko, eta aldian-aldian eguneratuko "
"da uneko botoekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session. In the chat, there is a message with the poll question, and the different choices. There is also a banner on the top of the chat, where you can see the question, and the number of votes for each answers.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/polls_start.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Poll start\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia. Txatean, inkestaren galdera eta aukera "
"desberdinak dituen mezu bat dago. Txataren goialdean banner bat ere badago, "
"non galdera eta erantzun bakoitzaren boto kopurua ikus daitezkeen.](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"polls_start.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Inkestaren hasiera\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "Viewers can then vote by clicking on their choice, or by sending message like \"!1\" in the chat."
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, ikusleek bozka dezakete beren aukeran klik eginez, edo \"!1\" "
"bezalako mezu bat txatean bidaliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "Votes counts will be updated regularly in the banner."
msgstr "Boto kopuruak aldian-aldian eguneratuko dira bannerrean."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "Viewers can change their vote at any time, just by making a new choice.  Their precedent choice will be replaced by the new one."
msgstr ""
"Ikusleek edozein unetan alda dezakete beren botoa, aukera berri bat eginez, "
"besterik gabe.  Aurreko aukera berriarekin ordeztuko da."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session, with an ongoing poll. The current user has just voted by sending \"!1\".](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/polls_votes.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Poll votes\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia, inkesta bat abian dagoela. Uneko "
"erabiltzaileak \"!1\" bidaliz bozkatu berri du.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/"
"images/polls_votes.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Inkestaren "
"botoak\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "Anonymous viewers can only vote once they have choosen their nickname."
msgstr "Ikusle anonimoek beren ezizena aukeratu ondoren soilik bozka dezakete."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "If \"{{% livechat_label poll_anonymous_results %}}\" is checked, votes won't be shown to other users.  If unchecked, votes will be publicly visible as you will see message like \"!1\" in the chat."
msgstr ""
"\"{{% livechat_label poll_anonymous_results %}}\" markatuta badago, botoak "
"ez zaizkie beste erabiltzaileei erakutsiko.  Desmarkatuta badago, botoak "
"publikoki ikusiko dira, \"!1\" bezalako mezuak ikusiko baitituzu txatean."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "For viewers using XMPP clients or outdated livechat plugin versions, the banner will not be visible.  But they will see the message in the chat and will be able to vote by sending messages with their choices."
msgstr ""
"XMPP bezeroak edo livechat osagarriaren bertsio zaharkituak erabiltzen "
"dituzten ikusleentzat, bannerra ez da ikusiko.  Baina mezua txatean ikusiko "
"dute, eta bozkatu ahal izango dute beren aukerak dituzten mezuak bidaliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "When the poll ends, a new message will be sent in the chat, with the results."
msgstr "Inkesta amaitzean, mezu berri bat bidaliko da txatean, emaitzekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session, with poll that has ended. The banner no more accept new votes. There is a message in the chat with the poll results. For each choice, there is the number of votes, and the percentage of the total it represents.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/polls_end.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Poll end\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia, amaitutako inkesta batekin. Bannerrak "
"ez du boto berririk onartzen. Txatean inkestaren emaitzak dituen mezu bat "
"dago. Aukera bakoitzerako, boto kopurua eta guztizkoaren zer ehuneko den "
"agertzen dira.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"polls_end.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Inkestaren amaiera\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/polls.md
msgid "The only way to get old polls results is to search for the poll end message in the chat.  For now, polls results are not saved by any other means.  So don't forget to note polls results if you want to keep them."
msgstr ""
"Inkesta zaharren emaitzak lortzeko modu bakarra txatean inkestaren amaierako "
"mezua bilatzea da.  Oraingoz, inkesten emaitzak ez dira beste inolako "
"modutan gordetzen.  Beraz, ez ahaztu inkesten emaitzak idaztea gorde nahi "
"badituzu."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plugin peertube-plugin-livechat slow mode"
msgstr "peertube-plugin-livechat osagarriaren modu motela"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Slow mode"
msgstr "Modu motela"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "As a streamer, you can choose to rate limit your viewers messages in the chat."
msgstr "Igorle gisa, zure ikusleen mezuen maiztasuna muga dezakezu txatean."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "This can be really usefull to:"
msgstr "Hau oso erabilgarria izan daiteke:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "avoid message flooding"
msgstr "mezu-uholdeak saihesteko"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "avoid unreadable chat if there are many viewers talking"
msgstr "ikusle asko hizketan ari badira, txata irakurtezina izatea saihesteko"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "You can set a number of seconds that users will have to wait after sending a message, before sending another."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek mezu bat bidali ondoren beste bat bidali aurretik itxaron "
"beharko duten segundo kopurua ezar dezakezu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "This limitation does not apply to moderators."
msgstr "Muga hau ez zaie moderatzaileei aplikatzen."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Slow mode option"
msgstr "Modu motelaren aukera"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "On the [channel configuration page](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/channel), you can set the slow mode option:"
msgstr ""
"[Kanalaren konfigurazio-orrian](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/"
"streamers/channel), modu motelaren aukera ezar dezakezu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the channel options form, with a slow mode field.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/slow_mode_channel_option.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Channel configuration / Slow Mode\")"
msgstr ""
"![Kanalaren aukeren inprimakiaren pantaila-argazkia, modu motelaren eremu "
"batekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"slow_mode_channel_option.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Kanalaren "
"konfigurazioa / Modu motela\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "Setting the value to a positive integer will set the period during which users will not be able to post additional messages."
msgstr ""
"Balioa zenbaki oso positibo batean ezartzeak erabiltzaileek mezu "
"gehigarririk argitaratu ezin duten epea ezarriko du."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "To modify the value for an already existing room, just open the room \"configuration\" menu (on top of the chat window), and change the slow mode value in the configuration form."
msgstr ""
"Lehendik dagoen gela baten balioa aldatzeko, ireki gelaren \"konfigurazioa\" "
"menua (txat-leihoaren goialdean), eta aldatu modu motelaren balioa "
"konfigurazio-inprimakian."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For viewers"
msgstr "Ikusleentzat"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "If the slow mode is enabled, users will be informed by a message."
msgstr ""
"Modu motela gaituta badago, erabiltzaileei mezu baten bidez jakinaraziko "
"zaie."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session. There is a banner on the bottom of the chat, indicating that the slow mode is enabled, and that users can send a message every 2 seconds.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/slow_mode.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Slow mode infobox\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia. Txataren behealdean banner bat dago, "
"modu motela gaituta dagoela eta erabiltzaileek mezu bat bidal dezaketela 2 "
"segundoan behin adierazten duena.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"slow_mode.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Modu motelaren informazio-"
"koadroa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/slow_mode.md
msgid "When they send a message, the input field will be disabled for X seconds (where X is the slow mode duration)."
msgstr ""
"Mezu bat bidaltzen dutenean, idazteko eremua desgaituta egongo da X segundoz "
"(X modu motelaren iraupena izanik)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can handle tasks and task lists with your moderation team."
msgstr ""
"Zereginak eta zeregin-zerrendak kudea ditzakezu zure moderazio-taldearekin."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tasks / To-do lists"
msgstr "Zereginak / Egitekoen zerrendak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "The livechat plugin includes a Task Application: a kind of \"to-do list\" feature where you can create task lists and add tasks to them.  Every room's admins have access to these tasks, so you can edit them collaboratively."
msgstr ""
"Livechat osagarriak Zereginen Aplikazio bat dakar: \"egitekoen zerrenda\" "
"moduko eginbide bat, non zeregin-zerrendak sor ditzakezun eta haietan "
"zereginak gehitu.  Gela bakoitzeko administratzaile guztiek zeregin "
"hauetarako sarbidea dute, elkarlanean editatu ahal izateko."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "You can for example use the Task Application to:"
msgstr "Adibidez, Zereginen Aplikazioa erabil dezakezu:"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "prepare a list of themes you want to discuss during your livestream, so you can be sure you won't forget anything"
msgstr ""
"zure zuzeneko igorpenean landu nahi dituzun gaien zerrenda bat prestatzeko, "
"ezer ahaztuko ez duzula ziurtatzeko"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "highlight questions from your viewers, so you can come back to them later without forgetting to answer them"
msgstr ""
"zure ikusleen galderak nabarmentzeko, geroago haietara itzuli eta erantzutea "
"ahaztu gabe"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Task Application"
msgstr "Zereginen Aplikazioa erabiltzea"

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Opening the Task Application"
msgstr "Zereginen Aplikazioa irekitzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "To open the Task Application, there is a \"{{% livechat_label \"tasks\" %}}\" button in the top chat menu:"
msgstr ""
"Zereginen Aplikazioa irekitzeko, \"{{% livechat_label \"tasks\" %}}\" botoi "
"bat dago txataren goiko menuan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a Peertube video, with the chat on the right. The chat top menu is open, with a \"{{% livechat_label tasks %}}\" button.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_open_app_video.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Opening the Task Application\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTube bideo baten pantaila-argazkia, txata eskuinean duela. Txataren "
"goiko menua irekita dago, \"{{% livechat_label tasks %}}\" botoiarekin.](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_open_app_video.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Zereginen "
"Aplikazioa irekitzea\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a Peertube chat, fullscreen. The chat top menu open, with a \"{{% livechat_label tasks %}}\" button.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_open_app_fullpage.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Opening the Task Application\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTube txat baten pantaila-argazkia, pantaila osoan. Txataren goiko "
"menua irekita, \"{{% livechat_label tasks %}}\" botoiarekin.](/peertube-"
"plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_open_app_fullpage.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Zereginen "
"Aplikazioa irekitzea\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "Clicking this button will toggle the Task Application display:"
msgstr ""
"Botoi honetan klik eginez, Zereginen Aplikazioa erakutsi edo ezkutatuko da:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a Peertube video, with the chat on the right. The Task application is open. There is a task list, and a form to create a new task.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_app_video_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Task Application\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTube bideo baten pantaila-argazkia, txata eskuinean duela. Zereginen "
"aplikazioa irekita dago. Zeregin-zerrenda bat dago, eta zeregin berri bat "
"sortzeko inprimaki bat.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_app_video_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Zereginen "
"Aplikazioa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a Peertube chat, fullscreen.  The Task application is open. There is a task list, and a form to create a new task.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_app_fullpage_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Task Application\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTube txat baten pantaila-argazkia, pantaila osoan.  Zereginen "
"aplikazioa irekita dago. Zeregin-zerrenda bat dago, eta zeregin berri bat "
"sortzeko inprimaki bat.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_app_fullpage_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Zereginen "
"Aplikazioa\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "Every room's admins have access to the Task Application (read and write access)."
msgstr ""
"Gela bakoitzeko administratzaile guztiek Zereginen Aplikaziorako sarbidea "
"dute (irakurtzeko eta idazteko)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "When you promote someone as room admin or owner, they gets instant access to the Task Application.  When you remove admin or owner rights to someone, they instantly lose access to the Task Application."
msgstr ""
"Norbait gelaren administratzaile edo jabe bihurtzen duzunean, berehala "
"izango du Zereginen Aplikaziorako sarbidea.  Norbaiti administratzaile edo "
"jabe eskubideak kentzen dizkiozunean, berehala galduko du Zereginen "
"Aplikaziorako sarbidea."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Task lists"
msgstr "Zeregin-zerrendak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "By default, there is one task list that has the same name as your livestream."
msgstr ""
"Lehenespenez, zure zuzeneko igorpenaren izen bera duen zeregin-zerrenda bat "
"dago."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "You can use the form at the bottom to create a new task list.  You can also edit existing task lists using the edit button, or delete any task list. Deleting a task list will also delete all its tasks."
msgstr ""
"Behealdeko inprimakia erabil dezakezu zeregin-zerrenda berri bat sortzeko.  "
"Lehendik dauden zeregin-zerrendak ere edita ditzakezu editatzeko botoia "
"erabiliz, edo edozein zeregin-zerrenda ezabatu. Zeregin-zerrenda bat "
"ezabatzeak haren zeregin guztiak ere ezabatuko ditu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "Task lists are sorted alphabetically."
msgstr "Zeregin-zerrendak alfabetikoki ordenatuta daude."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session, with the Task application. There are several task lists.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_app_task_lists.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Task lists\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia, Zereginen aplikazioarekin. Hainbat "
"zeregin-zerrenda daude.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_app_task_lists.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Zeregin-"
"zerrendak\")"

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tasks"
msgstr "Zereginak"

#. type: Title ####
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create tasks"
msgstr "Sortu zereginak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "You can create a task using the button on the right of task lists.  This opens a form with two fields: a mandatory task name, and an optional description."
msgstr ""
"Zeregin bat sor dezakezu zeregin-zerrenden eskuineko botoia erabiliz.  "
"Horrek bi eremu dituen inprimaki bat irekiko du: zereginaren izen "
"derrigorrezkoa, eta aukerako deskribapen bat."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the task application. Under the first task list, there is a form to create a new task.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_app_task_form.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Task form\")"
msgstr ""
"![Zereginen aplikazioaren pantaila-argazkia. Lehen zeregin-zerrendaren "
"azpian, zeregin berri bat sortzeko inprimaki bat dago.](/peertube-plugin-"
"livechat/images/task_app_task_form.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Zeregin-inprimakia\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the task application. Under the first task list, a new task was created.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_app_task_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Task created\")"
msgstr ""
"![Zereginen aplikazioaren pantaila-argazkia. Lehen zeregin-zerrendaren "
"azpian, zeregin berri bat sortu da.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_app_task_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Zeregina sortu da\")"

#. type: Title ####
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit tasks"
msgstr "Editatu zereginak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "Tasks can be edited by using the edit button on the right."
msgstr "Zereginak eskuineko editatzeko botoia erabiliz edita daitezke."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "Tasks can be marked complete (or uncomplete) by clicking directly on the checkbox in the list."
msgstr ""
"Zereginak osatutzat (edo osatu gabetzat) marka daitezke zerrendako kontrol-"
"laukian zuzenean klik eginez."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the task application. Under task lists, there are several tasks. Some of them are checked, other not.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_app_task_2.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Tasks\")"
msgstr ""
"![Zereginen aplikazioaren pantaila-argazkia. Zeregin-zerrenden azpian, "
"hainbat zeregin daude. Horietako batzuk markatuta daude, beste batzuk ez.](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_app_task_2.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Zereginak\")"

#. type: Title ####
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sorting tasks / change task list"
msgstr "Zereginak ordenatzea / zeregin-zerrenda aldatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "You can sort tasks, or move tasks from one list to another, simply using drag & drop."
msgstr ""
"Zereginak ordena ditzakezu, edo zerrenda batetik bestera eraman, arrastatu "
"eta jareginez, besterik gabe."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the task application. There is a task that is dragged over another.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_drag_drop.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Drag and drop to sort\")"
msgstr ""
"![Zereginen aplikazioaren pantaila-argazkia. Zeregin bat beste baten gainera "
"arrastatzen ari da.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_drag_drop.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Arrastatu eta "
"jaregin ordenatzeko\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the task application. There is a task that is dragged over another task list.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_drag_drop_task_list.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Drag and drop to move to another list\")"
msgstr ""
"![Zereginen aplikazioaren pantaila-argazkia. Zeregin bat beste zeregin-"
"zerrenda baten gainera arrastatzen ari da.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_drag_drop_task_list.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Arrastatu "
"eta jaregin beste zerrenda batera eramateko\")"

#. type: Title ####
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a task from a chat message"
msgstr "Sortu zeregin bat txat-mezu batetik"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "You can create a task from a message in a chat, using the \"{{% livechat_label \"task_create\" %}}\" button in the dropdown menu at the right of the message.  This will open a dialog box where you can choose which task list you want to add the task into.  The task name will be the user nickname, and the task description the message content."
msgstr ""
"Txateko mezu batetik zeregin bat sor dezakezu, mezuaren eskuineko "
"goitibeherako menuko \"{{% livechat_label \"task_create\" %}}\" botoia "
"erabiliz.  Horrek elkarrizketa-koadro bat irekiko du, zeregina zein zeregin-"
"zerrendatan gehitu nahi duzun aukeratzeko.  Zereginaren izena "
"erabiltzailearen ezizena izango da, eta zereginaren deskribapena mezuaren "
"edukia."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session. The menu besides a message is open, with a button to create a new task.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_from_message_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Create task from message\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia. Mezu baten ondoko menua irekita dago, "
"zeregin berri bat sortzeko botoiarekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_from_message_1.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Sortu zeregina "
"mezutik\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a dialog, where you can choose in which task list you want to add the new task.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_from_message_2.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Choose the task list\")"
msgstr ""
"![Elkarrizketa-koadro baten pantaila-argazkia, zeregin berria zein zeregin-"
"zerrendatan gehitu nahi duzun aukeratzeko.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_from_message_2.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Aukeratu "
"zeregin-zerrenda\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the task application. A new task was added in the \"chat questions\" task list, with the user's nickname, and the message as content.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/task_from_message_3.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Task created\")"
msgstr ""
"![Zereginen aplikazioaren pantaila-argazkia. Zeregin berri bat gehitu da "
"\"txateko galderak\" zeregin-zerrendan, erabiltzailearen ezizenarekin eta "
"mezua eduki gisa.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"task_from_message_3.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Zeregina sortu "
"da\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/tasks.md
msgid "Using this feature, for example, you can ask your moderators to highlight all chat questions, so you can see them at a glance during your livestream, and check them as answered."
msgstr ""
"Eginbide hau erabiliz, adibidez, zure moderatzaileei txateko galdera guztiak "
"nabarmentzeko eska diezaiekezu, zure zuzeneko igorpenean begirada batez "
"ikusteko eta erantzundakoak markatzeko."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure channel's chat terms & conditions"
msgstr "Konfiguratu kanalaren txataren baldintzak"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terms & conditions"
msgstr "Baldintzak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "You can add terms & conditions to your channel.  These terms will be shown to all users joining the chat."
msgstr ""
"Baldintzak gehi ditzakezu zure kanalean.  Baldintza hauek txatera sartzen "
"diren erabiltzaile guztiei erakutsiko zaizkie."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "To configure the terms & conditions, go to the [channel configuration page](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/channel):"
msgstr ""
"Baldintzak konfiguratzeko, joan [kanalaren konfigurazio-orrira](/peertube-"
"plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/channel):"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the channel options form, with a field to configure your terms and conditions.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/channel_terms_config.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Channel configuration / Terms\")"
msgstr ""
"![Kanalaren aukeren inprimakiaren pantaila-argazkia, zure baldintzak "
"konfiguratzeko eremu batekin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"channel_terms_config.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Kanalaren "
"konfigurazioa / Baldintzak\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "URL in the message will be clickable.  You can also do some styling: [Message Styling](https://xmpp.org/extensions/xep-0393.html)."
msgstr ""
"Mezuko URLetan klik egin ahal izango da.  Estilo batzuk ere eman ditzakezu: "
"[Mezuen estiloa](https://xmpp.org/extensions/xep-0393.html)."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewers"
msgstr "Ikusleak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "When joining the chat, viewers will see the terms:"
msgstr "Txatera sartzean, ikusleek baldintzak ikusiko dituzte:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session. On the top of the chat, there are terms and conditions for both the server and the channel.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/terms.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Terms\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia. Txataren goialdean, zerbitzariaren eta "
"kanalaren baldintzak daude.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"terms.png?classes=shadow,border&height=400px \"Baldintzak\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "Peertube instance's admin can also set global terms & conditions.  If so, these terms will be shown above your channel's terms."
msgstr ""
"PeerTube instantziako administratzaileek baldintza orokorrak ere ezar "
"ditzakete.  Hala bada, baldintza horiek zure kanalaren baldintzen gainean "
"erakutsiko dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "Anonymous users will only see the terms & conditions once they have chosen their nickname (in other words: once they are able to talk)."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaile anonimoek beren ezizena aukeratu ondoren soilik ikusiko dituzte "
"baldintzak (hau da: hitz egiteko gai direnean)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "You can change the terms content at any time, it will be instantly updated for all viewers."
msgstr ""
"Baldintzen edukia edozein unetan alda dezakezu; berehala eguneratuko da "
"ikusle guztientzat."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "Users can hide the terms & conditions.  When doing so, terms won't be shown again, unless you change the content."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek baldintzak ezkuta ditzakete.  Hala eginez gero, baldintzak ez "
"dira berriz erakutsiko, edukia aldatzen ez baduzu behintzat."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/streamers/terms.md
msgid "If your Peertube instance allows joining chat with [XMPP clients](https://livingston.frama.io/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/admin/advanced/xmpp_clients/), users using such clients will see the terms as chat messages, coming from a \"Peertube\" account.  When you update terms, they will receive a new message with the update terms content."
msgstr ""
"Zure PeerTube instantziak [XMPP bezeroekin](https://livingston.frama.io/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/admin/advanced/xmpp_clients/) txatera "
"sartzea baimentzen badu, bezero horiek erabiltzen dituztenek baldintzak txat-"
"mezu gisa ikusiko dituzte, \"Peertube\" kontu batetik etorrita.  Baldintzak "
"eguneratzen dituzunean, mezu berri bat jasoko dute baldintzen eduki "
"eguneratuarekin."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to chat for stream viewers"
msgstr "Nola txateatu igorpenen ikusleek"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Joining chat rooms"
msgstr "Txat-geletara sartzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "When you are watching a Peertube video that has the chat activated, you will see the chat next to the video:"
msgstr ""
"Txata aktibatuta duen PeerTube bideo bat ikusten ari zarenean, txata "
"bideoaren ondoan ikusiko duzu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/_index.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a Peertube video page, with a web chat on the right of the video.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/chat.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Chat screenshot\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTube bideo-orri baten pantaila-argazkia, txat bat bideoaren eskuinean "
"duela.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"chat.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Txataren pantaila-argazkia\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "There are two slightly different use cases, depending on wether or not you have an account on the Peertube instance.  See bellow for more informations."
msgstr ""
"Bi erabilera-kasu apur bat desberdin daude, PeerTube instantzian kontua "
"duzun ala ez kontuan hartuta.  Ikusi behean informazio gehiagorako."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you haven't a Peertube account"
msgstr "PeerTube konturik ez baduzu"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "If you are not logged in on the Peertube instance where you are watching the video, you will automatically join the chat.  You will be assigned a random nickname (something like \"Anonymous 12345\")."
msgstr ""
"Bideoa ikusten ari zaren PeerTube instantzian saioa hasita ez baduzu, "
"automatikoki sartuko zara txatera.  Ausazko ezizen bat esleituko zaizu "
"(\"Anonymous 12345\" bezalako zerbait)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat. In the participant list, there is John Livingston, and an anonymous account using \"Anonymous 212873\" nickname.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/chat_with_anonymous.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Chat with an anonymous user\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat baten pantaila-argazkia. Parte-hartzaileen zerrendan, John Livingston "
"dago, eta \"Anonymous 212873\" ezizena erabiltzen duen kontu anonimo bat.](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"chat_with_anonymous.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Txata "
"erabiltzaile anonimo batekin\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "Before being able to speak in the chat room, you have to enter a nickname in the field on the bottom of the window."
msgstr ""
"Txat-gelan hitz egin ahal izan aurretik, ezizen bat idatzi behar duzu "
"leihoaren behealdeko eremuan."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the chat. The current user is not logged in, and must choose a nickname before being able to write in the chat.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/chat_anonymous.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Joining chat when not connected\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txataren pantaila-argazkia. Uneko erabiltzaileak ez du saioa hasita, eta "
"ezizen bat aukeratu behar du txatean idatzi ahal izan aurretik.](/peertube-"
"plugin-livechat/images/chat_anonymous.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Txatera sartzea konektatu gabe\")"

#. type: Title ####
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in using an external authentication provider"
msgstr "Hasi saioa kanpoko autentifikazio-hornitzaile bat erabiliz"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "The Peertube instance can configure external authentication providers (Mastodon accounts, Google accounts, ...).  In such case, you will see a \"{{% livechat_label login_using_external_account %}}\" button, that will open a dialog modal.  In this dialog modal, there will be some buttons to connect using a remote account."
msgstr ""
"PeerTube instantziak kanpoko autentifikazio-hornitzaileak konfigura ditzake "
"(Mastodon kontuak, Google kontuak, ...).  Kasu horretan, \"{{% "
"livechat_label login_using_external_account %}}\" botoi bat ikusiko duzu, "
"elkarrizketa-koadro modal bat irekiko duena.  Elkarrizketa-koadro horretan, "
"urruneko kontu bat erabiliz konektatzeko botoi batzuk egongo dira."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "Once you signed in the remote account, and have granted access, your nickname and avatar (if available) will be automatically fetched.  No other data will be stored.  These data will be automatically deleted several hours after your quit the chat."
msgstr ""
"Urruneko kontuan saioa hasi eta sarbidea eman ondoren, zure ezizena eta "
"abatarra (eskuragarri badaude) automatikoki eskuratuko dira.  Ez da beste "
"daturik gordeko.  Datu hauek automatikoki ezabatuko dira txatetik irten eta "
"zenbait ordura."

#. type: Title ###
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have a Peertube account"
msgstr "PeerTube kontu bat baduzu"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "If you are connected with your Peertube account, you will automatically join the room, using your Peertube nickname and avatar."
msgstr ""
"Zure PeerTube kontuarekin konektatuta bazaude, automatikoki sartuko zara "
"gelara, zure PeerTube ezizena eta abatarra erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "If you are watching a live on an instance on which you have no account, but you have an account on another instance: if the livechat plugin is installed on both instances, it is possible to join the chat using your account.  To do so, just open the video on your instance (you can for example copy/paste the video url in the search field of your instance)."
msgstr ""
"Konturik ez duzun instantzia bateko zuzeneko bat ikusten ari bazara, baina "
"beste instantzia batean kontua baduzu: livechat osagarria bi instantzietan "
"instalatuta badago, zure kontua erabiliz sar zaitezke txatera.  Horretarako, "
"ireki bideoa zure instantzian (adibidez, bideoaren URLa kopiatu eta itsats "
"dezakezu zure instantziako bilaketa-eremuan)."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have a Peertube account on another Peertube instance"
msgstr "Beste PeerTube instantzia batean PeerTube kontua baduzu"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "If you have a Peertube account, but not on the current instance, there is a \"{{% livechat_label login_using_external_account %}}\" button.  This button will open a dialog where you can enter your Peertube instance URL.  Once you entered it, it will check if the livechat plugin is available on the remote instance, and if the video is available.  If it is the case, you will be redirected to the video on the remote instance."
msgstr ""
"PeerTube kontu bat baduzu, baina ez uneko instantzian, \"{{% livechat_label "
"login_using_external_account %}}\" botoi bat dago.  Botoi honek elkarrizketa-"
"koadro bat irekiko du, zure PeerTube instantziaren URLa idazteko.  Idatzi "
"ondoren, livechat osagarria urruneko instantzian erabilgarri dagoen eta "
"bideoa erabilgarri dagoen egiaztatuko du.  Hala bada, urruneko instantziako "
"bideora birbideratuko zaitu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the \"{{% livechat_label login_using_external_account %}}\" dialog. There is a field where you can enter a Peertube url.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/external_login_dialog.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"External login dialog\")"
msgstr ""
"![\"{{% livechat_label login_using_external_account %}}\" elkarrizketa-"
"koadroaren pantaila-argazkia. PeerTube URL bat idazteko eremu bat dago.](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"external_login_dialog.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Kanpoko saio-"
"hasierako elkarrizketa-koadroa\")"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chatting"
msgstr "Txateatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "To send messages, just type them in the \"message\" field on the bottom of the screen.  You can send them by pressing the enter key on your keyboard, or by clicking on the \"send\" button."
msgstr ""
"Mezuak bidaltzeko, idatzi pantailaren behealdeko \"mezua\" eremuan, besterik "
"gabe.  Teklatuko sartu tekla sakatuz bidal ditzakezu, edo \"bidali\" botoian "
"klik eginez."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "If you want to add line breaks in your messages, you can use the \"shift+enter\" key combination."
msgstr ""
"Zure mezuetan lerro-jauziak gehitu nahi badituzu, \"shift+enter\" tekla-"
"konbinazioa erabil dezakezu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "You can add emojis to your messages.  You can for example use the emojis menu, or directly type emojis shortcuts like `:smiley:`."
msgstr ""
"Emojiak gehi ditzakezu zure mezuetan.  Adibidez, emojien menua erabil "
"dezakezu, edo zuzenean idatzi emojien lasterbideak, `:smiley:` adibidez."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "You can mention other participants.  To do so, you can type the first nickname letters, then press the tab key.  You can also type `@`: this will directly open the menu.  You can also click on a nickname in the participants list to insert it in the message field."
msgstr ""
"Beste parte-hartzaile batzuk aipa ditzakezu.  Horretarako, idatzi ezizenaren "
"lehen letrak, eta sakatu tabuladore tekla.  `@` ere idatz dezakezu: menua "
"zuzenean irekiko da.  Parte-hartzaileen zerrendako ezizen batean klik egin "
"dezakezu mezu-eremuan txertatzeko."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Participants list"
msgstr "Parte-hartzaileen zerrenda"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "To see the list of participants, just open the right menu:"
msgstr ""
"Parte-hartzaileen zerrenda ikusteko, ireki eskuineko menua, besterik gabe:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat session, with on the right the list of participants.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/open_participants_list.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Participants list\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txat-saio baten pantaila-argazkia, eskuinean parte-hartzaileen zerrenda "
"duela.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"open_participants_list.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Parte-"
"hartzaileen zerrenda\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "You can see that some participants have special rights (moderator, owner, ...)."
msgstr ""
"Parte-hartzaile batzuek eskubide bereziak dituztela ikus dezakezu "
"(moderatzailea, jabea, ...)."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat dropdown menu"
msgstr "Txataren goitibeherako menua"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "There is a dropdown menu on the top of the chat, with some advanced features.  This is especially useful for [moderation features](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/moderation).  Available features depends on your access level."
msgstr ""
"Txataren goialdean goitibeherako menu bat dago, eginbide aurreratu "
"batzuekin.  Bereziki erabilgarria da [moderazio-eginbideetarako](/peertube-"
"plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/moderation).  Eskuragarri "
"dauden eginbideak zure sarbide-mailaren araberakoak dira."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Opening full screen"
msgstr "Pantaila osoan irekitzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "On top of the chat, there is a button to open the chat in fullscreen.  This will open a new browser tab with the following content:"
msgstr ""
"Txataren goialdean, txata pantaila osoan irekitzeko botoi bat dago.  Horrek "
"nabigatzailearen fitxa berri bat irekiko du eduki honekin:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "![Screenshot of a chat using the full web page.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/fullscreen.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Fullscreen chat screenshot\")"
msgstr ""
"![Web-orri osoa erabiltzen duen txat baten pantaila-argazkia.](/peertube-"
"plugin-livechat/images/fullscreen.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px "
"\"Pantaila osoko txataren pantaila-argazkia\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "It can be easier to chat using a full browser tab."
msgstr ""
"Errazagoa izan daiteke nabigatzaileko fitxa oso bat erabiliz txateatzea."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Changing nickname"
msgstr "Ezizena aldatzea"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "You can change your nickname by typing `/nick your_new_nickname` in the message field."
msgstr ""
"Zure ezizena alda dezakezu mezu-eremuan `/nick your_new_nickname` idatziz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/viewers.md
msgid "You can also change your nickname using the chat menu."
msgstr "Zure ezizena txataren menua erabiliz ere alda dezakezu."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect to chat using a XMPP client"
msgstr "Konektatu txatera XMPP bezero bat erabiliz"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "XMPP Clients"
msgstr "XMPP bezeroak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
msgid "This chat plugin relies on the XMPP protocol (also known as Jabber).  It is therefore possible to connect to the chats using [XMPP client software](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XMPP#Clients).  This can be useful for example to facilitate moderation operations."
msgstr ""
"Txat-osagarri hau XMPP protokoloan oinarritzen da (Jabber izenez ere ezaguna)"
".  Beraz, txatetara konekta daiteke [XMPP bezero-softwarea](https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XMPP#Clients) erabiliz.  Hori erabilgarria izan "
"daiteke, adibidez, moderazio-eragiketak errazteko."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
msgid "The features described on this page must be enabled and configured by your Peertube instance's administrators. You may therefore not have access to them."
msgstr ""
"Orri honetan deskribatutako eginbideak zure PeerTube instantziako "
"administratzaileek gaitu eta konfiguratu behar dituzte. Beraz, baliteke "
"haietarako sarbiderik ez izatea."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
msgid "If this feature is enabled on your instance, you can connect to Peertube chats using any XMPP account."
msgstr ""
"Eginbide hau zure instantzian gaituta badago, PeerTube txatetara konekta "
"zaitezke edozein XMPP kontu erabiliz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
msgid "To get the address of the room you want to join, you can use the \"share chat\" button that is located above the chat:"
msgstr ""
"Sartu nahi duzun gelaren helbidea lortzeko, txataren gainean dagoen "
"\"partekatu txata\" botoia erabil dezakezu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
msgid "![Screenshot of the chat, with a share button on the top.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/share_button.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Share button\")"
msgstr ""
"![Txataren pantaila-argazkia, goialdean partekatzeko botoi batekin.](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"share_button.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Partekatzeko botoia\")"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
msgid "By default, the share button is only visible to the owner of the video, and the admins/moderators of the instance.  However, admins can decide to display this button for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Lehenespenez, partekatzeko botoia bideoaren jabeak eta instantziako "
"administratzaile/moderatzaileek soilik ikusten dute.  Hala ere, "
"administratzaileek botoi hau guztiei erakustea erabaki dezakete."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
msgid "Then, choose \"{{% livechat_label connect_using_xmpp %}}\":"
msgstr "Ondoren, aukeratu \"{{% livechat_label connect_using_xmpp %}}\":"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/documentation/user/xmpp_clients.md
msgid "Then you just have to click on \"open\" or copy/paste the address of the chat room into your XMPP client (using the \"join a room\" feature)."
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, \"ireki\" aukeran klik egin besterik ez duzu egin behar, edo txat-"
"gelaren helbidea kopiatu eta itsatsi zure XMPP bezeroan (\"gela batera "
"sartu\" eginbidea erabiliz)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: support/documentation/content/en/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Peertube plugin livechat documentation"
msgstr "PeerTube livechat osagarriaren dokumentazioa"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: support/documentation/content/en/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Peertube livechat"
msgstr "Peertube livechat"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/_index.md
msgid "You can use the language selector in the left menu to view this documentation in different languages.  Some translations are missing or incomplete. In this case, you'll see the English version of the text."
msgstr ""
"Ezkerreko menuko hizkuntza-hautatzailea erabil dezakezu dokumentazio hau "
"hainbat hizkuntzatan ikusteko.  Itzulpen batzuk falta dira edo osatu gabe "
"daude. Kasu horretan, testuaren ingelesezko bertsioa ikusiko duzu."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/_index.md
msgid "Welcome the **Peertube Livechat Plugin** documentation."
msgstr "Ongi etorri **PeerTube Livechat osagarriaren** dokumentaziora."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/_index.md
msgid "[Peertube](https://joinpeertube.org/) is a decentralized streaming platform, that can provide both live streaming and VOD (Video On Demand) features.  The present plugin adds chatting capatibilities to your Peertube installation, allowing viewers to interract with streamers."
msgstr ""
"[PeerTube](https://joinpeertube.org/) bideo-plataforma deszentralizatu bat "
"da, zuzeneko igorpenak eta VOD (eskariko bideoa) eginbideak eskain "
"ditzakeena.  Osagarri honek txat-gaitasunak gehitzen dizkio zure PeerTube "
"instalazioari, ikusleei igorleekin elkarreragiteko aukera emanez."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/_index.md
msgid "To have a glimpse on this plugin capabilities, checkout the [introduction](/peertube-plugin-livechat/intro/). For more precise informations, please find bellow the summary of this documentation."
msgstr ""
"Osagarri honen gaitasunei begirada bat emateko, ikusi [sarrera](/peertube-"
"plugin-livechat/intro/). Informazio zehatzagoa izateko, behean duzu "
"dokumentazio honen aurkibidea."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/_index.md
msgid "You can use the searchbox in the left menu to quickly find specific documentation parts."
msgstr ""
"Ezkerreko menuko bilaketa-koadroa erabil dezakezu dokumentazioaren atal "
"zehatzak azkar aurkitzeko."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is the livechat plugin?"
msgstr "Zer da livechat osagarria?"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "This [Peertube](https://joinpeertube.org/) plugin is meant to provide a chat system for Peertube videos."
msgstr ""
"[PeerTube](https://joinpeertube.org/) osagarri honen helburua PeerTube "
"bideoetarako txat-sistema bat eskaintzea da."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "By default, once you have installed the plugin on your Peertube instance, a chat room will automatically be created for each live stream."
msgstr ""
"Lehenespenez, osagarria zure PeerTube instantzian instalatu ondoren, txat-"
"gela bat sortuko da automatikoki zuzeneko igorpen bakoitzerako."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "On the following screenshot, you can see a classic Peertube video page, with a chat room on the right (click on the picture to view it full screen):"
msgstr ""
"Hurrengo pantaila-argazkian, PeerTube bideo-orri klasiko bat ikus dezakezu, "
"txat-gela bat eskuinean duela (egin klik irudian pantaila osoan ikusteko):"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "The chat room will be accessible for all viewers, even those who don't have an account on your instance. Those \"anonymous\" users just have to choose a nickname before they can begin talking in the chat."
msgstr ""
"Txat-gela ikusle guztientzat egongo da eskuragarri, baita zure instantzian "
"konturik ez dutenentzat ere. Erabiltzaile \"anonimo\" horiek ezizen bat "
"aukeratu besterik ez dute egin behar txatean hitz egiten hasi aurretik."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "By default, the chat is displayed next to the video.  But you can open it in another browser tab, using the button on top of it :"
msgstr ""
"Lehenespenez, txata bideoaren ondoan erakusten da.  Baina nabigatzailearen "
"beste fitxa batean ireki dezakezu, haren gaineko botoia erabiliz:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "You can test the livechat plugin with this [demo page](https://www.yiny.org/w/399a8d13-d4cf-4ef2-b843-98530a8ccbae)."
msgstr ""
"Livechat osagarria [demo-orri](https://www.yiny.org/w/399a8d13-d4cf-4ef2-"
"b843-98530a8ccbae) honekin proba dezakezu."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalazioa"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "As a Peertube administrator, you can setup this plugin on your instance simply by using the Peertube plugin marketplace included in the administration interface.  Search for \"livechat\", then click \"install\": that's it!"
msgstr ""
"PeerTubeko administratzaile gisa, osagarri hau zure instantzian konfigura "
"dezakezu administrazio-interfazean dagoen PeerTube osagarri-dendaren bidez, "
"besterik gabe.  Bilatu \"livechat\", eta egin klik \"instalatu\" aukeran: "
"hori da dena!"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "![Screenshot of Peertube plugins admin page. The search fields contains \"livechat\", and the search results show the livechat plugin.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/installation.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Livechat installation\")"
msgstr ""
"![PeerTuberen osagarrien administrazio-orriaren pantaila-argazkia. Bilaketa-"
"eremuan \"livechat\" dago, eta bilaketaren emaitzetan livechat osagarria "
"agertzen da.](/peertube-plugin-livechat/images/"
"installation.png?classes=shadow,border&height=200px \"Livechat instalazioa\")"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Livechat capabilities"
msgstr "Livechataren gaitasunak"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "The plugin has many advanced features.  As it is using the [XMPP](https://xmpp.org/) standard \"under the hood\", it is possible for Peertube administrators to allow advanced usages (connection using XMPP clients, chatbots, bridge to other chat protocols, ...).  More information in the relevant sections of this documentation."
msgstr ""
"Osagarriak eginbide aurreratu asko ditu.  Barnean [XMPP](https://xmpp.org/) "
"estandarra erabiltzen duenez, PeerTubeko administratzaileek erabilera "
"aurreratuak baimen ditzakete (XMPP bezeroen bidezko konexioa, txatbotak, "
"beste txat-protokolo batzuetarako zubiak, ...).  Informazio gehiago "
"dokumentazio honetako dagozkion ataletan."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "Peertube is part of the fediverse: you can create a network of Peertube instances, sharing content between them."
msgstr ""
"PeerTube fedibertsoaren parte da: PeerTube instantzien sare bat sor "
"dezakezu, haien artean edukia partekatuz."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "This plugin can handle federation: when viewing a livestream from a remote instance, you will join the chat room with your local account.  You will be automatically connected with your current nickname and avatar."
msgstr ""
"Osagarri honek federazioa kudea dezake: urruneko instantzia bateko zuzeneko "
"igorpen bat ikustean, zure kontu lokalarekin sartuko zara txat-gelara.  "
"Automatikoki konektatuko zara zure uneko ezizenarekin eta abatarrarekin."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "Of course, for the federation to work, the plugin must be installed on both instances."
msgstr ""
"Jakina, federazioak funtziona dezan, osagarria bi instantzietan instalatuta "
"egon behar da."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "Some times, you have to protect your community from bad people.  As an instance administrator, you can choose to disallow federation for the livechat plugin.  If remote actors behave badly, streamers, moderators and administrators can ban or mute users."
msgstr ""
"Batzuetan, zure komunitatea pertsona gaiztoengandik babestu behar duzu.  "
"Instantziako administratzaile gisa, livechat osagarriaren federazioa ez "
"baimentzea aukera dezakezu.  Urruneko aktoreak gaizki portatzen badira, "
"igorleek, moderatzaileek eta administratzaileek erabiltzaileak debekatu edo "
"mututu ditzakete."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "This plugin comes with a built-in [chat bot](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/streamers/bot/).  Check its documentation for more information."
msgstr ""
"Osagarri honek [txatbot](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/user/"
"streamers/bot/) integratu bat dakar.  Ikusi haren dokumentazioa informazio "
"gehiagorako."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "You can also plug in any other XMPP chat bot, using [XMPP External Components](https://prosody.im/doc/components).  To do so, you just have to configure External Components access in the [plugin settings](/peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/admin/settings)."
msgstr ""
"Beste edozein XMPP txatbot ere konekta dezakezu, [XMPP kanpoko osagaiak]"
"(https://prosody.im/doc/components) erabiliz.  Horretarako, kanpoko osagaien "
"sarbidea konfiguratu besterik ez duzu egin behar [osagarriaren ezarpenetan](/"
"peertube-plugin-livechat/documentation/admin/settings)."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "When joining a room, you will see previous messages.  Even those sent before you joined the room."
msgstr ""
"Gela batera sartzean, aurreko mezuak ikusiko dituzu.  Baita gelara sartu "
"aurretik bidalitakoak ere."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "This behaviour can be changed room by room, and default retention duration can be chosen by instance's administrators."
msgstr ""
"Portaera hau gelaz gela alda daiteke, eta instantziako administratzaileek "
"gordetzeko iraupen lehenetsia aukera dezakete."

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Integrate the chat in your live stream"
msgstr "Integratu txata zure zuzeneko igorpenean"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "When using software as [OBS](https://obsproject.com) for you live stream, you can embed the chat in the video stream.  This is for example useful for replays."
msgstr ""
"Zure zuzeneko igorpenerako [OBS](https://obsproject.com) bezalako softwarea "
"erabiltzen duzunean, txata bideo-igorpenean txerta dezakezu.  Hori "
"erabilgarria da, adibidez, errepikapenetarako."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "In the following screenshot, you can see a live replay, where the chat content is embeded on bottom of the video:"
msgstr ""
"Hurrengo pantaila-argazkian, zuzeneko baten errepikapena ikus dezakezu, "
"txataren edukia bideoaren behealdean txertatuta duela:"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "In the following screenshot, you can see an OBS setup, where the chat is included as a source in the current scene (background color can be changed, and can be transparent):"
msgstr ""
"Hurrengo pantaila-argazkian, OBS konfigurazio bat ikus dezakezu, txata uneko "
"eszenan iturburu gisa sartuta duela (atzeko planoaren kolorea alda daiteke, "
"eta gardena izan daiteke):"

#. type: Title ##
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Other usages"
msgstr "Beste erabilera batzuk"

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "By default, each streamer will be able to activate/deactivate the chat for their live streams."
msgstr ""
"Lehenespenez, igorle bakoitzak bere zuzeneko igorpenetarako txata aktibatu/"
"desaktibatu ahal izango du."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "But on the instance level, administrators can choose to activate the chat for all videos (live and/or VOD)."
msgstr ""
"Baina instantzia mailan, administratzaileek bideo guztietarako (zuzenekoak "
"eta/edo VOD) txata aktibatzea aukera dezakete."

#. type: Plain text
#: support/documentation/content/en/intro/_index.md
msgid "You can even activate the chat for specific VOD videos.  This is how the [demo](https://www.yiny.org/w/399a8d13-d4cf-4ef2-b843-98530a8ccbae) page works: it is not a live stream, but I have activated the chat specifically for this video."
msgstr ""
"VOD bideo jakin batzuetarako ere aktiba dezakezu txata.  Horrela "
"funtzionatzen du [demo](https://www.yiny.org/w/399a8d13-d4cf-4ef2-b843-"
"98530a8ccbae) orriak: ez da zuzeneko igorpen bat, baina txata berariaz "
"aktibatu dut bideo honetarako."

